<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Chiku</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chikumbuchisyo cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malajisyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha chikumbuchisyo cha malajisyo chikuujila malajisyo gagatyosyekwe mu itabu ine ya malajisyo, yaani itabu nsano yaandanda mu Lilangano Lyakalakala yaikuŵilanjikwa Pentetuti. Mu Chiebulania liina lya chitabu chi malumbo gakwe “Maloŵe.” Ikukulupilichika kuti che Musa ni juŵalembile chitabu chi, ikaŵe liunjili lyalinandi lyakumbesi lyalikukunguluchila chiwa chao. Chitabu chi chikutanda kwakuti, “Gelega gali maloŵe ga che Musa gaŵasalile Ŵaisilaeli.” Indu yaikulosya kuti che Musa ni juŵalembile chitabu chi ikuloleka sooni mmalo gampepe mu Lilangano lya Sambano. Chisau mu chitabu cha masengo ga achinduna mu sula ja 3:22-23, che Petulo paakujila maloŵe gagali mu Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo mu sula ja 18:15-18 ni alembile kwakuti gelega galiji maloŵe ga che Musa. Ikukomboleka kuti che Musa ni juŵalembile chitabu chi pamo ni chitabu cha Ndandililo ni Kutyoka ni Indu yapanganyisye Ŵalawi ni chitabu cha Kuŵalanga pasikati ja yaka 1300 pane 1400 Akanaŵe kupagwa Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo chalembekwe mpela majilano pasikati ja mwenye jumo ni umwenye wine wakuutawala, mpela iyatite kutendekwa kalakala. Lili lilangano pasikati ja Akunnungu ni ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli. Akunnungu ŵakundile kwapa upile ŵandu, naga akakundile kugakuya ni kugapilikanichisya malajisyo gakwe. Iŵaga Ŵaisilaeli akakanile kwitichisya malajisyo ga Akunnungu akajamwikwe. Chelechi chili chindu chekulungwa chachisalilikwe mwamujinji mu chitabu chi chose, nambo nnopennope mu sula ja 27 mpaka sula ja 28, sikusalichisya au usyene wu sichilosyaga upile wajikajika ni malweso gagakwika kwa ligongo lya kwitichisya pane ungajitichisya wa ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli. Ngosyo syakupisyangana sya Ŵaisilaeli syajimi pa matumbi gaŵili gakupisyangana gagakulolegana, katema ŵane akupeleka upile ni ŵane akulwesya kwa kunyanyisya, kulosya kuti alikundile lilangano.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Che Musa akukumbuchisya iyasimene Ŵaisilaeli paŵajendaga mwipululu, mu sula jandanda mpaka sula jaatatu.</para>
  <para style="io">Iyasachilwaga mu lilangano pasikati ja Akunnungu ni ŵandu ŵakwe, mu sula ja ncheche mpaka ja ishilini na sita.</para>
  <para style="io">Ŵaisilaeli akuŵecheta upile ni malweso kwa kunyanyisya, kulosya kuti kutyochela pelepo lilangano likupanganya masengo, mu sula ja ishilini na saba mpaka sula ja selasini.</para>
  <para style="io">Kumbesi che Musa akuŵecheta maloŵe gakumalichisya ku che Yoshua ni kwa kila lukosyo lwa Ŵaisilaeli akanaŵe kuwa, mu sula ja selasini na moja mpaka sula ja selasini na nne.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Malajisyo ku chitumbi cha Holebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Chitabu chi chana maloŵe ga che Musa gaŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli katema kaŵaliji mwipululu kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani. Ŵaliji ku lichemba lya Yolodani chiŵandi ni malo jajikuŵilanjikwa Sufu, upaande umo kwaliji ni musi wa Palani ni upande wine kwaliji ni misi ja Tofeli ni Labani, ni Haseloti ni Disahabu. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Lwendo lwa moŵa kumi na moja kutyochela ku chitumbi cha Holebu pane chikuŵilanjikwa chitumbi cha Sinai, mpaka ku Kadeshi Balinea kwa litala lyalikupitila mmatumbi gagakuŵilanjikwa Seili. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Chaka cha alobaini pa lyuŵa lya ndanda lya mwesi wa kumi na moja pakumala kutyoka ku Misili, Che Musa ŵaasalile ŵandu indu yose iŵalajiswe ni Ambuje Akunnungu kuti ŵaasalile. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Yelei yaliji pakumala Ambuje Akunnungu kwapunda che Sihoni mwenye jwa Ŵaamoli, juŵatawalaga musi wa ku Heshiboni, ni mwenye che Ogu jwa ku Bashani juŵatawalaga misi ja ku Ashitaloti ni ku Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Paŵaliji kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani ku chilambo cha ku Moabu, Che Musa ŵatandite kwasalila ŵandu malamusi ga Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Waasalile yeleyi, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Patwaliji kuchitumbi cha Sinai kula, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵetu ŵatusalile kuti, ‘Ntemi katema kakaleu pachitumbi pa, sano ikwanile. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Sambano ntyokangane, njendelechele ni ulendo wenu mpaka ku chilambo cha matumbi ga Ŵaamoli ni ku ilambo yaiŵandichile ku Alaba, kwakuli ni itumbi ni machemba ni kwele ku Negebu ni mu mbwani mose. Njaule mpaka chilambo cha Kanaani ni ku Lebanoni, mpaka lusulo lwekulungwa lwalukuŵilanjikwa Eufulate. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Nnole nampele chilambo chi ŵanyamwe. Mpela une Ambuje Akunnungu inatite pakwalumbilila achachekulu ŵenu che Abulahamu ni che Isaka, che Yakubu ni uŵelesi wao. Njinjilanje mwelemo nkatame ni kuchitenda chiŵe chenu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Musa akwasagula ilongola.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Kutyoka 18:13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Che Musa ŵaasalile ŵandu kuti, “Katema katwaliji chiŵela pachitumbi cha Sinai, une nansalile kuti, ‘Masengo gakunnongosya ŵanyamwe gandopile. Ngangukombola jika. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, antesile mme achajinji, lelo ntupile mpela ndondwa sya kumaunde. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa achambuje ŵenu, antende kuwa achajinji maelufu kwa maelufu, ipunde yantite kuŵa sano ni kumpa upile mpela iŵatite kulanga! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Nambo une jika chingombole chinauli kuchenjeuchila masauko genu? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Mwasagule ŵandu ŵaali ni lunda, ni umanyilisi, ni ŵakuchimbichikwa, kutyochela mu ngosyo syenu, none chinaatende aŵe ilongola ŵenu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Mwanyamwe mwajanjile kuti, ‘Chindu chinsasile chili chambone kukwetu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Nipele naajigele ilongola ŵenu ŵaali ni lunda, ni ŵakuchimbichikwa, umwasagwile kutyochela mu ngosyo syenu, natesile kuŵa ilongola ŵenu. Naaŵisile ŵane aŵe ilongola ŵa ŵandu elufu moja, ni ilongola ŵa ŵandu mia moja, ni ilongola ŵa ŵandu hansini, ni ilongola ŵa ŵandu likumi. Naasagwile achakulu ŵane ŵakwimilila ŵandu mu kila lukosyo.”<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Patwaliji pepala, naasalile ŵakulamula ŵenu, ‘Ngapikanile magambo ga achalongo ŵenu, nkalamule pangali lusagu, iŵeje pasikati ja Mwisilaeli ni Mwisilaeli pane Mwisilaeli ni jwanlendo jwakutama pasikati jao. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Pankulamula nkaŵa ni lusagu, mwapikanile wosepe yalumo, jwankulungwa atamuno mwanache. Nkanjogopa mundu jwalijose, pakuŵa ulamusi unkutyosya ukutyochela kwa Akunnungu. Ligambo lyalililyosye lyannemaga mumbelechele une, none chinalilamule.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Kele katema ko nansalile kila chindu chinkusachilwa kupanganya.”<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Musa akwatuma ŵakuuchilichisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Kuŵalanga 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Nipele, mpela Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu iŵatulamwile uwe, twautandite ulendo wetu kutyochela kuchitumbi cha Holebu, twapitile ku chipululu chachikulungwa chakogoya chimwachiweni chila, twapitile litala lyalikwaula kuchilambo cha matumbi ga Ŵaamoli. Patwaiche ku Kadesh Balinea, <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />une nansalile, ‘Sano nnyiiche pachilambo cha matumbi ga Ŵaamoli, chilambo chaatupele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Nnole, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akumpa chilambo chachili mbujo mwenu, Hayaga! Nkajinjile chikaŵe chenu mpela Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa achachekulu ŵenu iŵatite pakunsalila. Nkajogopa namose nkapwa ntima!’”<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Nipele wose mwanyichilile ni mwaasalile, ‘Twatume ŵandu, akachiuchilichisye chilambo, sooni auje kutusalila litala lyambone lyachitupite, ni misi jachitujijaulile yajitite kuŵa.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Liloŵe li lyanonyele une, nipele, naasagwile ŵandu kumi na mbili, mundu jumo kutyochela mu kila lukosyo. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Ŵandu wo ŵapite kuchilambo cha matumbi, ŵaiche kulichemba lya Eshikoli ni ŵachiulichisye. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Paŵausile, ŵatujigalile isogosi impepe iŵakaŵile kuchilambo kula ni ŵatusalile kuti chilambo chaakutupa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu chili chambone.”<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />“Nambo mwanyamwe mwagakanile malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu wenu, ni nganinjaula kuchilambo kula. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Mwalalataga ndi mmasakasa genu, mwatiji, ‘Ambuje akutuchima uwe, lyele ni ligongo atutyosisye ku chilambo cha ku Misili kuti ŵaatende Ŵaamoli atukamule ni kutuulaga. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Kwachichi tujaule kweleko tuli tupwele mitima kwa lipamba? Atusalile kuti ŵandu ŵa kweleko ali makammandu, sooni atupundile uleu, ni misi jao jikusile ni jesyunguchisye makumba gamaleu kuichila kumaunde. Sooni ŵatite kuti ŵaaweni makammandu, yaani uŵelesi wa Ŵaanaki!’”<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Nambo nansalilenje kuti, ‘Nkakola lipamba namose ngasimwajogopanga.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ŵakunnongolela chamenyane nawo kwaligongo lyenu mpela iŵatite pakuntendela nli nkulola pamwaliji ku Misili kula, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />ni kulipululu kula. Mwaweni Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kunjigala ni kunnyichisya pangali masausyo mpela atati yakuti kunjangata mwanagwe mpaka ŵannyichisye apano. <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Atamuno ŵagatesile gele gosego, ŵanyamwe nganimwakulupilila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />juŵannongwesye mu ulendo wenu ni kunsosela liuto limwaŵisile chigono chenu. Chilo ŵannongwesye kwa luchanamila lwa mooto ni musi ŵannongwesye kwa luchanamila lwa liunde kuti annanjile litala.”<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ambuje Akunnungu akwajamuka Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Kuŵalanga 14:20-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapilikene kudandaula kwenu, yaachimile, ŵalumbilile achitiji, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Ngapagwa mundu jwalijose mu uŵelesi wa chigongomalo wu juchajinjile mu achila chilambo chambone chinaalumbilile kwapa achachekulu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Che Kalebu mwana ju che Yefune jikape ni juchajinjile mu chilambo cho, none chinaape chilambo chaaliŵete cho chiŵe chakwe ni uŵelesi wakwe ligongo ali jwakukulupilichika kukwangu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵandumbilile ni une jwakwe ligongo lyenu mwanya, ŵatite, ‘Atamuno mmwe che Musa nganjinjila mu chilambo cho. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Nambo nkamusi jwenu che Yoshua mwana ju che Nuni, tajinjile mwelemo. Nipele mwalimbisye ntima pakuŵa jwelejo ni jutiŵalongosye Ŵaisilaeli akachijigale chilambo cho chiŵe chao.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“Sooni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatusalile uwe ŵanawose, ‘Aŵala ŵanache ŵenu umwatite kuti chajigalikwe mateeka, yaani ŵanache ŵali achanandi ŵangakuimanyilila yaili yambone pane yangalimate, ŵanyawo ni ŵatajinjile mu chilambo cho. Une chinape chilambo cho kuti chiŵe chao. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Sambano ŵanyamwe ngalauche mmujangane ku lipululu kwa litala lyalikwaula ku bahali ja Shamu.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Nipele mwanyanjile kuti, ‘Uwe twaleŵele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu nambo sano tutujaule kukumenyana mpela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu yatite kutulajisya.’ Nipele kila mundu ŵajigele yakumenyanila ngondo, nchiganisyaga kuti ngailema kuchigunguchila chilambo cha matumbi cho.”<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />“Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile, ‘Mwasalile ŵandu wo akajaula ku ngondo ko pakuŵa une ngama nao pamo. Chinkaputikwe ni ŵammagongo ŵao.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Nipele nansaalile, nambo nganimumbikanila. Mwakanile kugakuya malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, kwa chibuli chenu mwajawile kuchilambo cha matumbi. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Pelepo, Ŵaamoli ŵaŵatamaga ku liuto lya matumbi lyo ŵatulwiche kukwagunguluchila ni kwatopola mpela ŵandu ŵakutopolwa ni nyuchi, mpaka ku Seili ni kwapunda ku musi wa ku Holima. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ni pamwausile, mwalisile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, nambo nganampikanila namose nganankosya.”<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaka iŵatemi ku lipululu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />“Kwayele mwatamilisye nnope ku Kadeshi ko, malinga ni moŵa gamwatemi kweleko.”<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />“Nipele twausile, ni kwaula ulendo wa kulipululu kwalitala lya bahali ja Shamu mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kuunajisya. Kwa moŵa gamajinji twasyungulagasyungulaga ku chilambo cha matumbi ga Seili.”<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile kuti, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />tusyungwilesyungwile mu chilambo cha matumbi chi kwa moŵa gamajinji, sano tugalauche, tujaule chakumpoto. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Ŵaasalile kuti nansalile ŵanyamwe malajisyo ga: ‘Mmaandichile kupita pasikati ja chilambo cha matumbi ga Seili, chilambo cha achalongo achinjenu uŵelesi wa che Esau. Ŵanyawo chanjogope, nambo nlilolechesye. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Nkaputana nawo ligongo ngasinampa malo gagaligose nkati chilambo cho. Ngasinampa atamuno malo jenandi ja pakuliŵata. Chilambo cha matumbi ga Seili cho napele uŵelesi wa che Esau kuti chiŵe chao. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Pachinkasache chakulya pane meesi kutyochela kukwao, nipele nkasume.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />“Nipele nkumbuchile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu yatite pakumpa upile mu yose yantesile. Ŵangosile ŵanyamwe pamwaliji mu ulendo wenu mu ali lipululu lyekulungwa. Ŵaliji pamo ni ŵanyamwe yaka yose alobaini ni nganichinsoŵa chindu chachilichose.”<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Nipele twajendelechele ni ulendo, twapite kwa achalongo ŵetu uŵelesi wa che Esau ŵaŵatamaga ku Seili. Twalilesile panyuma litala lya ku Alaba, sooni ni misi ja Elati ni Esioni Gebeli. Ni twagalawiche ni kulikuya litala lyakupitila ku lipululu lya Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile ‘Nkaasausya atamuno nkaputana ni ŵandu ŵa ku Moabu ŵali uŵelesi u che Lutu, pakuŵa naapele ŵanyawo musi wa ku Ali uŵe wao. Ni ŵanyamwe ngangumpa malo gagaligose mu musi wo.’” <verse eid="DEU 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Kalakala ko musi wa ku Ali ŵatamaga Ŵaemi, makammandu ni achajinji ni ŵa machili ŵaŵaliji achaleu mpela Ŵaanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Mpela yatite kuŵa Ŵaanaki, ŵanyawo nombe ŵaŵilanjikwe Ŵalefai, nambo Ŵamoabu ŵaaŵilasile Ŵaemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Kuundanda ko Ŵaholi nombe ŵatemi ku Seili, nambo uŵelesi wa che Esau ŵaatopwele ni kwajonanga, nipele ŵanyawo ŵatemi pamalo po. Ŵaislaeli nombe ŵatesile iyoyo peyo paŵajinjilaga ku chilambo chiŵapele Ambuje Akunnungu kuti chiŵe chao.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />“Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatusalile, ‘Ntyokangane sano, njomboche kasulo Seledi.’ Nipele, twajombweche kasulo ko. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Pakumala kutyoka ku Kadeshi Balinea mpaka komboka kasulo ka Seledi yapitile yaka salasini na nane. Kele katema ko, uŵelesi wose wa ŵandu uŵaliji ni lisusa lya kukwanila kwaula kuputana ngondo ŵamasile kuwa mpela iŵatite Ambuje Akunnungu pakwalumbilila. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Ambuje Akunnungu asyene ŵajendelechele kwaputa mpaka paŵajonasile pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli, ni wose ŵamasile.”<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />“Nipele, ŵandu ŵaŵaliji ni lisusa lya kukwanila kwaula kungondo paŵamasile kuwa, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Lelo jino chijomboche mpika wa ku Moabu pakupitila litala lya musi wa ku Ali. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Chinnyiche chilambo cha Ŵaamoni ŵaali isukulu i che Lutu. Ngasimwasausya atamuno ngasimputana nawo pakuŵa ngasinampa malo gagaligose ga chilambo chao kuti gaŵe genu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />“Chilambo cho chikumanyika kuti chili cha Ŵalefai. Kalakala Ŵalefai ŵatemi kweleko, ni Ŵaamoni ŵaaŵilasile ŵanyawo Ŵazanzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Ŵazanzumi wo ŵatupile, ni ŵamachili, ŵaliji makammandu ni achaleu mpela Ŵaanaki. Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajonasile katema kaŵaiche Ŵaamoni ŵaŵachijigele chilambo cho ni kutama mwelemo pamalo pao. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatesile mpela iŵatite kwatendela Ŵaedomu ŵaŵaliji uŵelesi wa che Esau, ŵaŵatamaga ku chilambo cha Seili. Ŵajonasile Ŵaholi katema Ŵaedomu paŵaiche kweleko, ŵachitesile chilambo kuŵa chao ni kutama mwelemo mpaka lelo jino. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Chitandilile cho Ŵaaŵi ŵatamaga mmisinda jajili mungulugulu bahali ja Meditelania mpaka ku Gasa. Ŵakafitoli yaani ŵandu ŵakutyochela ku chilumba cha ku Kilete ŵaajonasile, ni kutama mwelemo pamalo pao.”<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Patwapite chilambo cha ku Moabu, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatusalile: ‘Sambano ntande ulendo ni komboka lichemba lya Alinoni. Une nampele machili ga kwaputa che Sihoni, mwenye jwa Ŵaamoli jwa ku Heshiboni ni chilambo chakwe. Mwagungumuchile ni kutanda kuchijigala chilambo cho chiŵe chenu. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Kutandilila lelo chinjatenda ŵandu anjogope ni kukola lipamba kwa ligongo lyenu; Ŵandu ŵa pachilambo pose uchapilikane ngani syenu chatetemele ni kusupuka.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akumpunda mwenye che Sihoni.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Kuŵalanga 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Nipele nalajisye ŵandu kutyochela ku lipululu lya Kedemoti ajaule kwa mwenye che Sihoni jwa ku Heshiboni ni utenga wa chitendewele waukuti, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />‘Choonde ntulechelele tupite mu chilambo chenu. Chitujende mwitala pe sokotaa. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Chitusume chakulya tulye ni mesi ga kung'wa. Choonde ntulechelele tupite mu chilambo chenu wamakongolo, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />mpela iŵatulechelele uŵelesi u che Esau ŵakutama ku Seili, ni Ŵamoabu ŵakutama ku Ali. Mpaka tujomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kwinjila mu chilambo chakutupa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />“Nambo che Sihoni, mwenye jwa ku Heshiboni, nganatulechelela tupite mu chilambo chao. Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ŵaatesile aŵe ni ntima wakulimba ni wa makani kuti twapunde ni kuchijigala chilambo chao chiŵe chetu, mwatukutama mpaka lelo jino.”<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile, ‘Nnole nguntendekasya mumpunde mwenye che Sihoni pamo ni chilambo chao. Nipele ntande kuchijigala chilambo chao kuti chiŵe chenu.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Nipele che Sihoni ŵajawile pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe wose kukuputana nowe ku musi wa ku Yahasa. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Nombe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu ŵatukombolechesye uwe kwakamula, nombe uwe twammuleje pamo ni achiŵanagwe ni ŵangondo ŵakwe wose. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Twajisumwile misi jao ni kujijonanga, twauleje achalume ni achakongwe ni ŵanache; nganitunsigasya mundu jwalijose ali jwanjumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Twajigele ilango yao ni ipanje yose itwaisimene mmisi jao. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Kutandilila ku Aloeli, musi wauli mungulugulu lichemba lya ku Alinoni ni musi wauli nkati mwa lichemba lyo mpaka ku Gileadi, ngapagwa musi wauli wose uwalimbangene uwatulemile kwasumula. Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu ŵatukombolechesye kujijigala misi jose. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Nambo nganituŵandichila chilambo cha Ŵaamoni atamuno mungulugu lusulo lwa Yaboki, atamuno misi jajili mu chilambo cha matumbi, atamuno malo gagali gose gaŵatukanyisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu kwinjila.”<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akumpunda mwenye che Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Kuŵalanga 21:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Nipele twagalawiche ni kwaula ku Bashani. Mwenye che Ogu ŵatyosile ni ŵandu ŵakwe wose kwika kukuputana ni uwe chiŵandi ni musi wa ku Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile, ‘Nkajogopa pakuŵa une nantendekasisye mwapunde ŵandu ŵakwe wose ni chilambo chakwe. Mwatende mpela imwatendele che Sihoni mwenye jwa Ŵaamoli juŵatawalaga ku Heshiboni kula.’”<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵatutendekasisye twapunde che Ogu mwenye jwa ku Bashani ni ŵandu ŵakwe, twaauleje wose, nganitunsigasya mundu jwalijose. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Twajisumwile misi jose ngapagwa atamuno musi umo utwaulesile. Misi jitwajisumwile jaliji misi sitini, yaani misi jose ja Aligobu jati mwenye che Ogu jwa ku Bashani ŵatawele. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Misi jose ji jaliji ni makome gagali ni makumba gamaleu, gagali ni milango ni njinjili sya chisyano. Nombe kwaliji ni misinda jejinji jangasunguchisya makumba. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Twajijonasile misi jose ni kwaulaga achalume, achakongwe, ni ŵanache mpela itwatite pakumpanganyichisya che Sihoni mwenye jwa ku Heshiboni. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Nambo ilango yose pamo ni ipanje twajigele ni kuitenda yetu.”<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Katema kala twasumwile chilambo mamwenye ŵaŵili ŵa Ŵaamoli ŵaŵatemi pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani, pasikati ja lusulo lwa Alinoni ni chitumbi cha Helimoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Chitumbi cha Helimoni Ŵasidoni akuchiŵilanga Silioni, nombe Ŵaamoli akuchiŵilanga Senili. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Twasumwile misi jao jajili ku chiŵata, sooni ni malo jose ja ku Gileadi ni ku Bashani mpaka ku Saleka ni ku Edilei, misi ja mwenye che Ogu jajili ku Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />“Mwenye che Ogu ni juŵasigele jika munkutule wa Ŵalefai. Chindanda chao chaliji chekolosye ni chisyano, chaliji ni uleu wa mita ncheche ni chanchijipi mita siŵili, malinga ni ipimo isyoŵelechekwe. Chindanda cho chili chiŵela mu musi wa Ŵaamoli kwele ku Laba ko.”<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngosyo sisyatemi kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Kuŵalanga 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Pakumala kuchijigala chilambo chila, naapele ngosyo sya Lubeni ni Gadi liuto lyalili kumpoto kwa musi wa ku Aloeli chiŵandi ni lusulo lwa Alinoni malo ga chilambo cha matumbi ga Gileadi, pamo ni misi jakwe. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Nipele mbindikati ja ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Manase naapele liuto lilyasigele muchilambo cha Gileadi pamo ni ku Bashani kose kuŵatawele che Ogu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 3:13">“Liuto lyose lya Aligobu mu chilambo cha Bashani lyamanyiche kuti chilambo cha Walefai. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Mundu jumo jwa lukosyo lwa Manase juŵaŵilanjikwe che Yaili, ŵajigele liuto lyose lya chilambo cha Aligobu yaani Bashani kuichila mumpika wauli pasikati ja Geshuli ni Maaka. Misinda jose ŵajipele lina lyakwe, ni lelojino jikuŵilanjikwa Hawoti Yaili yaani misinda ja che Yaili.”<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />“Ŵandu ŵa nnango wa che Makili ŵa lukosyo lwa Manase napele chilambo cha Gileadi. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Ni ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Lubeni ni Gadi naapele chilambo chose kutandilila ku Gileadi mpaka ku lusulo lwa Alinoni. Mpika wao cha kulujenda waliji pasikati pa lusulo nombe cha kumpoto waliji kulusulo lwa Yaboki uwapakene ni chilambo cha Ŵaamoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Mpika wao chakumaswelelo lyuŵa waiche ku lusulo lwa Yolodani, chakumpoto wajendelechele mpaka ku litanda lya Galilaya, chakulujenda wajendelechele mpaka kujili bahali ja njete, ni chakungopochelo lyuŵa mpaka wao waiche ku chitumbi cha Pisiga.”<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Katema kakoko nansalile, ‘Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ampele chilambo chi chakungombochelo lyuŵa mwa lusulo lwa Yolodani kuti chiŵe chenu. Sambano ŵanyamwe ŵangondo ŵanli ni yakumenyanilana, njomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani kwakamuchisya ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine sya ku Isilaeli kwigala ilambo yao. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Nambo achiŵankwenu ni ŵanache ŵenu ni inyama yenu, pakuŵa ngumanyilila kuti nkwete ilango yejinji, chaasigale ku misi jinampele. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Mwakamusye achalongo achinjenu Ŵaisilaeli mpaka pele pachajigale chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu chiŵape kumaswelelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani ni mpaka pele Ambuje Akunnungu pachiŵatende atame kweleko mu chitendewele mpela yatite kupanganya ku ŵanyamwe. Pakumala yele ni pachinkombole kuuja ku ilambo yenu mwachinsyene.’”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Nipele nansalile che Yoshua, ‘Mmwe mwasyene nnyiweni indu yose yati Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu iŵaatesile ŵele mamwenye ŵaŵili wo, yaani che Sihoni ni che Ogu. Kwanti iyoyo ni itajile pakwapanganyichisya mamwenye ŵa ilambo yose ichinkasumule. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Nnaajogope pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tamenyane nawo kwaligongo lyenu.’”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Musa akukanikwa kwinjila ku Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Katema ko naachondelele Ambuje Akunnungu njitiji, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, ntandite kuunosya une jwakutumichila jwenu ukulu wenu ni ukombole wenu. Pakuŵa nnungu chi jwali kwinani pane pachilambo jwakukombola kutenda indu yekulungwa ni yakusimonjeka mpela inkuitenda alakwe? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />None ngunchondelela mungunde nyomboche, ngachione chilambo chambone chachili pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani, pamo ni chilambo chambone cha matumbi ga Lebanoni.’”<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵandumbilile kwa ligongo lyenu, ŵakanile kumbikanila. Pamalo pakwe ŵasalile, ‘Ikwanile! Nkaŵecheta sooni liloŵe li. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Nkwele mpaka ku lusonga lwa litumbi lya Pisiga, nnole yambone mbande sya kulikuswelela lyuŵa ni kumpoto ni kulujenda ni kungombochelo lyuŵa, nchilole chilambocho; nambo mmwe nganjomboka alu lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Nambo mwalajisye che Yoshua, nkaatulasye ntima ni kwalimbikasya, pakuŵa ŵelewo ni uchiŵalongosye ŵandu ŵa, ajomboche lusulo mpaka pesi ni kuchijigala chilambo chachinchiwone ni kuchitenda chao.’”<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Nipele, twasigele palichemba palapala, chiŵandi ni musi wa Beti Peoli.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Che Musa akwasalila Ŵaisilaeli kuti aŵeje ŵakwitichisya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Che Musa ŵajendelechele kwasalila Ŵaislaeli kuti, “Ngapilikanile malamusi ni majiganyo gingunjiganya kuti nkatame ni kuchitenda chiŵe chenu chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa achachekulu ŵenu akumpanga. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Ngasinjonjechesya chachilichose mmakanyo gingumpanga, atamuno ngasimpungusya chindu. Nkamulichisye malamusi gose ga Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu, gingumpanga. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Ŵanyamwe mwalionele indu iŵaipangenye Ambuje Akunnungu akula ku Baali Peoli. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu ŵaauleje ŵandu ŵa munkutule mwenu ŵaŵampopelelaga jwele nnungu Baali Peoli jo. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Nambo ŵanyamwe umwaliji ŵakukulupilichika kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu, ndi chiŵela ŵajumi mpaka lelojino.”<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Nnole nanjigenyenje makanyo ni malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangu yatite pakuunajisya mbanganye, kuti nkamulichisye pachinjinjile mu chilambo chinkwaula kuchitenda chenu cho. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Nkamulichisye kwakulupilichika malajisyo go, ni yelei tiyalosye ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine kuti mwanyamwe nli ŵandu ŵanli ni luunda ni pachapikane yankati malamusi go chajile, ‘Kusyene ŵandu ŵa chilambo chekulu chino akwete luunda ni umanyilisi.’<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />“Ngapagwa chilambo chachilichose namose chiŵe ni ukulu wanti uli, chanti nnungu jwakwe ali chiŵandi nawo, mpela yatite kutuŵandichila uwe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵetu, patukwaŵenda akutukamuchisya. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Ni ngapagwa chilambo chine chachilichose atamuno chikule chantiuli, chachili ni makanyo ni malajisyo gagakwanonyelesya Akunnungu, mpela ginanjigenye une lelojino. <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Nambo njende mbole ni kulilolesesya, ngasinyika kuliŵalila indu yandiwonele mwachinsyene. Nkaika kugaliŵalila aila indu inlionele mwachinsyene. Ikaika kutyochela atamuno kamo mu ndamo syenu indu yo kuliŵalikwa mmitima jenu, mwaajiganye ŵanache ni isukulu yenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Nkumbuchile lyuŵa limwajimi paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu, ku Holebu kula, pasalile, ‘Mwasonganganye ŵandu wo paujo pangu, kuti naasali maloŵe gangu agapikanile kuti alijiganye kunyitichisya une moŵa gose mu ndamo syao syose, ni kwajiganya ŵanache ŵao kutenda yeleyo.’<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />“Nipele, mwaŵandichile ni kwima paasi mungulugulu litumbi lilyakolelaga mooto uwaiche mpaka kwinani lili liunichilwe ni liunde pii ni chipi totolo. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakungulwiche ni ŵanyamwe kutyochela pasikati pa mooto ula, nambo nsyene jo nganimummona, mwalipilikene liloŵe lyao pe. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Nombewo ŵansalile lilangano lyakwe ni kwalajisya nkamulichisye makanyo likumi gaŵalembile mu ibao iŵili ya maganga. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Kele katema ko Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaanajisye nanjiganye malajisyo ni makanyo gose gankusachilwa kugapanganya ku chilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala ni kuchitenda chenu pakumala komboka lusulo lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo ga kupopelela inyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Kwayele njende mbole, ngasinyika kuliŵalila kuti Ambuje Akunnungu paŵaŵechete ni ŵanyamwe ku chitumbi cha Holebu kula pasikati ja mooto nganimwaona uloleche wakwe. Kwayele nndilolechesye nnope, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />kuti nkatenda sambi kwa kulikolochesya chinyago chachilichose, chakulandana ni chachilichose, iŵeje jwannume atamuno jwankongwe, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />pane chinyama chachilichose cha pachilambo namose chijuni, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />pane chinyama chachikukwaŵa atamuno somba sya mmesi. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Ni pankulola mwinani ni kuliwona lyuŵa ni mwesi ni ndondwa ni indu yose yaili kwinani, nkalinjikwa kuipopelela ni kuitumichila, pakuŵa indu yo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵaikolosisye kuti ŵandu wose pachilambo apoche kwa yeleyo. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Nambo ŵanyamwe ni uŵankulupusye kutyochela ku Misili mmalagasyo gamakulu mpela kukulupuswa mu chipala. Ŵankulupwisye kuti mme ŵandu ŵakwe mpela yantite kuŵa lelo jino. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ŵandumbilile kwaligongo lyenu, ni ŵalumbile kuti une nganyomboka lusulo lwa Yolodani kwaula nkati chilambo chachili ni chajila chakumpanga chiŵe chenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Une chimwilile pachilambo chino nganyomboka lusulo lwa Yolodani, nambo ŵanyamwe mmandichile komboka ni kwaula ku achila chilambo chachili ni chajila chinkwaulanga kutama ni kuchitenda chenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Ndilolechesye nnope ngasinyika kuliŵalila Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu lyapanganyisye ni ŵanyamwe. Ngasinlikolosyesya inyago yaili ni uloleche wa chindu chachilichose chankanyisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kwalandanya. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ali mooto waukutinisya; ŵelewo ali Akunnungu ŵali ni wiu.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Pachintame pachilambo po kwa yaka yejinji, pachinkole ŵanache ni wisukulu ni pachinchekulupe, nkatenda sambi kwakulikolochesya inyago yaili yose. Nkatenda ugongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kwatumbilisya. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Nipele une lelo ngusiŵilanga kwinani ni chilambo iŵe ŵaumboni pasikati jetu, ngunsalilanga kuti iŵaga ngankwitichisya, chinjonasiche kwanakamo kuchilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala chiŵe chenu, kwele pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani ko. Ngantamilisya nnope, nambo chinjonasiche tikitiki. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Ambuje Akunnungu champwilinganye pasikati ja ilambo yejinji, ŵandu kanandi pe ni utasigalile kwele kuchanjausye Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Kweleko chinkapopelele minungu ja itela ni maganga jesepekwe ni makono ga ŵandu, ni jajikulepela kulola ni ngajikupikana, ni ngajikulya atamuno ngajikunusya. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Kutyochela mu chilambo pemo chimwasose Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, iŵaga kweleko chimwasose kwa ntima wose ni mbumu jose chimwapate. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Masauko gose ga pachigampate kweleko kanyuma, chimwaujilile Ambuje Akunnungu ni kwajitichisya. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ali Akunnungu ŵa chanasa, ngasannekanga atamuno kunjonanga, namose ngaaliŵalila Lilangano liŵaliŵisile ni achachekulu ŵenu kwa kulumbilila.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Nganichisye nnope indu iyatendekwe kalakala nkanaŵe kupagwa, kutandilila pa lyuŵa Akunnungu paŵangumbile mundu pachilambo. Mmuchilichisye ku ilambo yose, iŵaga kwatyochele atamuno kupikanika chindu chakusimosya chanti nnyi. <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Uli, ŵandu ŵapikane liloŵe lya Akunnungu lichiŵechetaga kutyochela pasikati pa mooto, mpela yantite pakulipikana ŵanyamwe, ni kusigala ni umi? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Uli apali nnungu jwine juŵalinjile kwaula kwajigala ŵandu kutyochela mu chilambo chine kuti ŵaatende aŵe ŵakwe, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu, iŵatite pakuipanganya kwaligongo lyenu kwele ku Misili ko? Ŵaipangenye nli nkulola achitumiaga machili gakwe gamakulu, ni ukombole wakwe ni kuichisya iputiko ni ngondo, ŵaitesile yakusimonjeka ni imanyisyo ni sooni ŵatesile indu yejinji yakogoya ikopochele. <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Akunnungu ŵannosisye ŵanyamwe indu yo, kuti mmanyilile yakuti Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵali Akunnungu jikape, pangali ŵane. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Ŵantesile mpikane liloŵe lyao kutyochela kwinani kuti antende mme ŵandu ŵakwitichisya, ni pachilambo pa ŵantendekasisye muuone mooto wao wekulu ni kulipikana liloŵe lyao kutyochela pa mooto wo. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Pakuŵa ŵaanonyele achachekulu ŵenu, ŵansagwile ŵanyamwe ŵanli uŵelesi ŵao, ni kwa ukombole wao wekulu ŵankopwesye ku chilambo cha ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Ŵaŵinjile mbujo mwenu ŵandu ŵa ilambo yaili yekulungwa ni yaili ni machili ga kumpunda ŵanyamwe, kuti anjinjisye ni kumpa mwanya chilambo chao kuti chiŵe chenu, mpela yaitite kuŵa lelo jino. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Nipele, nkumbuchile lelo jino ni nnyitaje mmitima jenu, kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵaali Akunnungu kwinani ni pachilambo, ngapagwa ŵane. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Nipele ngakamulisye malajisyo gao ni malamusi gao gangumpa leo jino kuti mpate upile, mwanyamwe pamo ni uŵelesi wenu, ni kutamilisya moŵa gamajinji pa chilambo champele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misi ja kutilila ja kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Nipele che Musa ŵajisagwile misi jitatu jajili kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />jati mundu jwauleje pangaŵa yamele njakwe jwanganaŵa jwammagongo jwao, akakombwele kutilila. Mundu mpela jwele ikukomboleka kutilila nkati musi umo wakwe kuti akaulajikwa. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Ŵusagwile musi wa Beseli wauli kuchiŵata cha lipululu kwa ligongo lya lukosyo lwa Lubeni; musi wa Lamoti ku chilambo cha ku Gileadi kwa ligongo lya lukosyo lwa Gadi, ni musi wa Golani ku chilambo cha ku Bashani kwa ligongo lya lukosyo lwa Manase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndande ja kutyosekwa kwa malajisyo ga Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Ali lili lilajisyo lya che Musa liŵapele Waislaeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Aga ni malajisyo ni makanyo ni mashaliti gati che Musa ŵasalile Ŵaisilaeli natyokape ku Misili, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />paŵaliji pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani, kulichemba lyalili mmbujo mwa Beti Peoli, ku chilambo chichaliji cha mwenye che Sihoni jwa Ŵaamoli, ŵaŵatawele kutandilila ku musi wa Heshiboni, ŵaŵaputikwe ni che Musa ni Ŵaisilaeli natyokape ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Ŵachijigele chilambo chakwe ni chilambo cha mwenye che Ogu jwa ku Bashani. Mamwenye ŵaŵili ŵa Ŵaamoli wo ŵatawele chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Chilambo cho chajenele kutandilila ku Aloeli mungulugulu lusulo lwa Alinoni, mpaka kuchitumbi cha Silioni yani Helimoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />pamo ni malo jose ja kungombochelo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani mpaka ku Bahali ja Njete, kujipelele nduluko sya litumbi lya Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo likumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kutyoka 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Che Musa ŵaŵilasile pamo Waislaeli, ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe Ŵaisilaeli, mpilikane makanyo ni malajisyo gangugasala paujo penu lelojino. Nlijiganye gelego ni kwiwona kuti nkugajitichisya. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, ŵatesile lilangano ni uwe ku litumbi lya Holebu. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Nganatenda lilangano lyo ni achachekulu pe, nambo ŵatesile ni uwe wose ŵatuli ni umi lelojino. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaŵechete ni ŵanyamwe nli nkulolegana kutyochela pa mooto pa ku litumbi. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Katema ko najimi pasikati ja ŵanyamwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu, nansalilenje iŵaisasile, pakuŵa ŵanyamwe mwaujogwepe moto ula ni nganinkwela kulitumbi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">“Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatite, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘Une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, junankopwesye kuchilambo cha ku Misili, kumwaliji achikapolo.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“ ‘Ngasinjipopelela minungu jine ikaŵe une pe.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“ ‘Ngasindikolochesya inyago ya minungu, atamuno malinga ni chindu chachilichose chachili kwinani, atamuno chachili pasi pachilambo, atamuno chachili mmesi paasi chilambo.’” <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Ngasinyikotamila atamuno kuipopelela; pakuŵa une Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ndili Akunnungu jundi ni wiu. Ngwajamuka wananche kwaligongo lya sambi sya achatati ŵao, mpaka uŵelesi waatatu ni wancheche wa ŵaakunjima. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Nambo ngulosya unonyelo wangu kwa maelufu ga iŵelesi yaikunonyela ni kugakamulichisya malajisyo gangu.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“ ‘Nkalikolanga liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu iyiyipeyi, pakuŵa une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu ngaaneka kunjamuka jwalijose jwakulitumia liina lyangu kwa nningwa wangalumbana.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“ ‘Nlikamulisye Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila ni kulitenda lyuŵa lyo liŵe kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu mpela une Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu inguti kunnajisya. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Moŵa sita mpanganye masengo genu gose. <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />Nambo pa lyuŵa lya saba lili Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu. Pa lyuŵa lyo nkapanganya masengo gagaligose, namose mwanagwenu, atamuno mwali jwenu, namose kapolo jwenu jwannume pane jwankongwe, atamuno ng'ombe jwenu, namose mbunda jwenu, atamuno chinyama chenu chachilichose, namose jwannendo jwakutama pamalo penu, kuti kapolo jwenu jwannume ni jwankongwe nombe apumulile mpela yankuti kupumulila mmwe.’” <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Nkaliŵalila kuti mmwejo mwaliji kapolo ku chilambo cha ku Misili, none Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nankopwesye kwa machili ni ukombole wangu wekulu. Nipele une Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu nannamulile kuti nlikamulisye Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“ ‘Mwachimbisye atati ŵenu ni achikulu ŵenu, mpela uneji Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu indite pakunnamulila. Ntende yeleyo kuti ntame moŵa gamajinji ni indu yenu injendelechele yambone pachilambo chingumpanga.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“ ‘Nkaulaga.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“ ‘Nkatenda chikululu.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“ ‘Nkajiŵa.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“ ‘Nkapeleka umboni wa unami nkati njenu.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“ ‘Nkammilila mata jwankongwe jwa njenu. Kasinnajila nyuumba ja mundu jwaali chiŵandi ni mmwe pane ngunda wakwe, namose kapolo jwakwe jwannume pane jwankongwe, namose ng'ombe jakwe pane mbunda jakwe, atamuno chindu chilichose chakwete.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Aga ni maloŵe gati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile nsongangano wenu wose kwa liloŵe lyakunyanyisya kopochela pa mooto ni liunde ŵii ni chipi totolo, ni nganajonjechesya malajisyo gane. Nipele ŵagalembile mu ibao iŵili ya maganga iyasepekwe ni kuumba une.”<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Musa akuŵecheta ni ŵandu pamalo pa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Kutyoka 20:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Pamwapilikene liloŵe lyo lili nkutyochela mu chipi, litumbi lilinkukolela mooto, ilongola wose ŵa ngosyo syenu ni achachekulu ŵanyichilile une. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Ŵatite, ‘Mpilikane! Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, atulosisye kung'alima kwakwe ni ukulu wakwe; tupilikene liloŵe lyao lili nkutyochela pasikati ja mooto ula. Lelo twaweni Akunnungu alinkuŵecheta ni mundu, nombe mundu nganawa ŵajendelechele kuŵa jwanjumi. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Nambo kwachichi tuliŵiche mu chakogoya chachikuichisya chiwa, aula mooto wekulungwa chituulaje. Twalipikanaga sooni liloŵe lya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, kusyene chituwe. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Uli, mundu chi juŵampilikene Akunnungu ŵajumi achiŵechetaga kutyochela pasikati mooto mpela yatutite kwapikana uwe, nombejo wasigalile ŵajumi? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Mbaya mmweji che Musa njaule nkaŵandichile, nkaipikanile yose ichakaiŵechete Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, nipele njise kutusalila indu yose ichansalile. Uweji chituipilikanichisye ni kuijitichisya.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Ambuje Akunnungu ŵagapilikene maloŵe genu. Ŵasalile ‘Mbilikene maloŵe gaansalile ŵandu ŵa; gose gaasasile gali gambone. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Ikaŵe ŵana nganisyo mpela asino akanjimbichisyenje ni kugakamulichisya malajisyo gangu gose katema kose! Indu yao yosepe ikajendelechele chenene ŵanyao achimisyene ni uŵelesi wao moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Njaule nkaasalile aujangane mmasakao mwao. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Nambo mmwe che Musa nsigale apano ni une; kuti nampe makanyo gose, mashalaiti ni malajisyo gatimwajiganye kuti agakuye, ku chilambo chingwapa chiŵe chao.’”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Ŵanyamwe ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ndilolesyesye nkaipanganye mpela Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu yatite kunnajisya; mpanganye kila chindu kwa uchenene. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Mgakuye aila yose yalajisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kuti indu yenu injendelechele yambone ni nkombole kutama ndaŵi syejinji pa chilambo chachinjigale chiŵe chenu.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Lilajisyo lyekulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />Aga ni malajisyo, ni makanyo ni mashaliti ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, gaŵanajisye nanjiganye, kuti ngajitichisye ku chilambo chinkwaula kuchichigala chiŵe chenu, pakumala komboka lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Katema kose nli ŵajumi mwanyamwe mwajitichisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kugachimbichisya malajisyo gose ni makanyo gangumpa ŵanyamwe ni iŵelesi yenu kuti nkatame yaka yejinji. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Kwayele ŵanyamwe Ŵaisilaeli, nlilolesyesye kugapanganya malajisyo go kuti indu yenu injendechele yambone ni kuchuluka kwannope mu chele chilambo channanjile, chachili ni chajila, chachikufai kwa kulanga ni kulima.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />Mpilikane ŵanyamwe Ŵaisilaeli! Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, ali Ambuje jikape. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Nomwe mwanonyele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwa ntima wenu wose, kwa mbumu jenu jose ni kwa machili genu gose. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Nkagaliŵalila aga makanyo ga gingunnajisya lelojino, <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />ni kwajiganya ukoto ŵanache ŵenu. Chimwatanjile pachintame pamusi pane mu ulendo pane pankupumulila atamuno pankupanganya masengo. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Ngalembe ni kugataŵilila mmakono mwenu ni kuwala pausyo penu kuti gankumbuchisye. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Ngalembe mu felemu sya minango jenu ni mu milango jekulungwa jakwinjilila mu misi jenu.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa ŵandu ŵangapilikanichisya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Katema Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, patannyichisye ku chilambo chiŵaalumbilile achachekulu ŵenu, che Ibulahimu, ni che Isaka, ni che Yakubu, kumpa ŵanyamwe, chilambo chekulungwa, chachili ni misi jakusalala janganintaŵa, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />nyuumba syasigumbele indu yakusalala yanganinyiŵika ŵanyamwe, ni isima yanganinyisola ni migunda ja misabibu ni miseituni janganimpande. Ambuje Akunnungu pachampeleche ku chilambo chachimme ni chakulya chachili chose chachinsache. <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />Pelepo nlilolechesye kuti ngasimwaliŵalila Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaŵankopwesye ku Misili kumwaliji achikapolo. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Chimwajinichile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chimwatumichile ŵawowo jikape ni chinnumbile kwa liina lyawo. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Ngasimpopelela minungu jine, minungu ja ŵandu ŵakunsyungula, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />nkaatendekasya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu antumbilile, akanjonanga pachilambo, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵali pasikati penu, ali Akunnungu ŵa wiu.”<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Nkaalinga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, mpela imwatite kwalinga kwele ku Masa ko. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Nlilolechesye kuti nkugajitichisya makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, mashalaiti ni malajisyo gao ganlajisye. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Ntendeje aila yaikwanonyela Ambuje Akunnungu, kuti indu yenu injendechele yambone. Chinkombole kuchitenda chenu achila chilambo chakusalala chati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵalumbilile kwapa achachekulu ŵenu, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />ni kuti Ambuje Akunnungu chiŵatopole ŵammagongo ŵenu mpela yatite kunlanjila.”<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Yaka yaikwika mmbujo, ŵanache ŵenu patachimmusya kuti, ‘Kwachichi Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu ŵatulamwile kuti tugapikanileje malajisyo ni majiganyo gose ga?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Ŵanyamwe mwajanje kuti, ‘Uweji twaliji achikapolo ŵa mwenye jwa ku Misili nambo Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵatukulupwisye kwa ukombole wao wekulungwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Uweji twaweni kwa meso getu Ambuje Akunnungu, alinkwatendela ŵandu ŵa ku Misili imanyisyo ni ya kusimosya ni indu yakogoya kwannope, pamo ni mwenye jwao ni ŵandu ŵakwe wose. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu ŵatukopwesye ku Misili ni kutuichisya akuno, ŵatupele chilambo chi mpela iŵatite kulumbila kwa achachekulu ŵetu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatulamwile kuti tugajitichisye makanyo gosepe ga ni kwajinichila, twatendaga yele chatugose moŵa gose ni kututenda tupoche. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Twaŵaga ŵakukulupilichika kwitichisya kila chindu chatulajisye Ambuje Akuunungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, chanonyelwe ni uwe.’”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵakwe Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Kutyoka 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, pachanyichisye ku chilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala, chiŵatopole ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine kuti atyoche muchilambo mo. Pachinkajinjile mu chilambo mo, chiŵatopole paujo penu ŵandu ŵa ilambo saba yaikulungwa yaili ni machili kumpunda ŵanyamwe: Ŵahiti ni Ŵagiligashi ni Ŵaamoli ni Ŵakanaani, ni Ŵapelizi ni Ŵahivi ni Ŵayebusi. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Nombe, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, patankombolesye kwapunda ŵandu wo, nkusachilwa kwaulaga ŵanawose, nkatenda lilangano ni ŵanyao namose kwakolela chanasa. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Nkalombana nawo, atamuno nkaalombekasya achiŵali ŵenu atamuno achachanda ŵenu akalombela achiŵali ŵao. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Mwatendaga yeleyo chiŵalyungasye ŵanache ŵenu anaapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu, chiŵatendekasye ajipopelele minungu jine, yeleyo chiyachimikasye Ambuje Akunnungu, nombewo chanjonanje kwakwanguya. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Nambo mwapanganyichisye nnyi: Ngumulanje ilisa yao ya maganga, ni nsikate njanamila sya nnungu Ashela ni kuichoma mooto inyago yao. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Nkatende yeleyo pakuŵa ŵanyamwe nli ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ansagwile ŵanyamwe kutyochela pasikati ja ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo kuti mme ŵandu ŵakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“Ambuje Akunnungu, nganannonyela ni nganansagula ŵanyamwe pakuŵa ntupile kwapunda ŵandu ŵane; ŵanyamwe mwaliji ŵandu kanondi kusipunda ngosyo syose sya pachilambo. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannonyele ŵanyamwe ni kuchitindimisya chilumbilo chiŵachiŵisile kwa achachekulu ŵenu, lyelelyo ni ligongo ŵankulupwisye ŵanyamwe kwa ukombole wao wekulu, ni kunkoposya mu ukapolo kwa mwenye jwa ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Nipele, nkumbuchileje kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni jwali Akunnungu jikape; sooni ali Akunnungu ŵakukulupilichika, jwakugosa lilangano lyakwe sooni akulosya chanasa kwa iŵelesi yejinji ya ŵandu ŵakunnonyela ni kukamulichisya makanyo gakwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Nambo ŵandu ŵakwachima chiŵaalipe yaikusachilwa, ni ngaaleka kwajamuka kwakwajonanga ŵakwachima. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Kwayele ndilolechesye kugakamulisya makanyo, mashaliti ni malajisyo ganampele lelo jino.”<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upile kwa ŵandu ŵakwitichisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Iŵaga tingakamulichisye malajisyo ga, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, talitindimisye lilangano lyakwe ni kwendelechela kunnonyela ŵanyamwe mpela muŵaalumbiliile achachekulu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Tachinnonyela ni kumpa upile, ni ŵanyamwe chimmeleche ŵanache achajinji; chachipeleka upile mmigunda jenu kuti mpate magungulo, divai ni mauta; sooni tachimpa upile kwa kumpa ng'ombe ni ngondolo yejinji. Chachimpa indu yoseyo pachinkajinjile kuchilambo chiŵalumbilile achachekulu ŵenu kuti champe ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Chimpate upile kwapunda ŵandu ŵane wose pachilambo. Pasikati jenu ngaapagwa jwannume namose jwankongwe jwangaŵeleka, namose ngachipagwa chilango chachilichose changachiŵelaka. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Ambuje Akunnungu chaityosye ilwele yaili yose yakogoya pasikati jenu mpela iyampatile kwele ku Misili ko, nambo Ambuje Akunnungu tachiipeleka ilwele yo kwa ŵammagongo ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Nkaaulaje ŵandu ŵa chilambo chachilichose chichantesye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu mwapunde; nkaaonela chanasa. Ngasinjipopelela minnungu jao, pakuŵa yeleyo chichiŵe chitanji kukwenu.”<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Ngasindiusyausya mmitima jenu, ‘Ŵanduŵa atupile kutupunda uwe, chitukombole chinauli kwatopola pachilambo?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Ngasimwajogopa. Nkumbuchile aila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, yaitesile kwa mwenye jwa ku Misili pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe wosepe. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Nkumbuchile iputiko ya kogoya imwalionele, ilosyo ni yakusimosya, ni machili gamakulungwa ni ukombole wekulu, iŵaitesile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti antyosye ku Misili. Yeleyi ni itajile pakwapanganyichisya ŵandu ŵankwajogopa. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Kupunda yele, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, taichenawo matendeu pasikati jao mpaka ŵandu ŵachantoloche kuti alijuŵe ajonasikwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Nipele, ngasimwajogopa ŵandu ŵa, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ali pasikati jenu, ŵelewo ali Akunnungu ŵakulu ni ŵakogoya. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chiŵatopole ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine kanondikanondi pankwaula mmbujo. Ngankombola kwajonanga wose kwanakamo, ligongo mwatendaga yeleyo inyama ya mwitinji chiitupe ni kunjogopasya. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chankombolesye kwapunda ŵammagongo ŵenu, chiŵaatende achenjeuche, kumbesi ko chajonasiche. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Chimwapunde mamwenye ŵao. Chimwaulaje, nombe chaaliŵalikwe. Ngapagwa mundu jwalijose juchakombole kunkanya, mpaka pachimwajonanje ŵanawose. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Nkaitinisye inyago ya minungu jao ni mooto. Ngasimmilila mata madini ga feza atamuno sahabu syao, ngasinjigala ni kusitenda kuŵa syenu, mwatendaga yeleyo chiŵe chitanje kukwenu, ni ŵanyamwe chimwachimikasye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Nkajigala indu yaikunchimikasya Ambuje Akunnungu mmajumba mwenu, nkaika kulweseka mpela indu yo. Nkusachilwa kuichima ni kuinyelusya indu yo pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ailwesisye.”<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Njitichisye kwakukulupilichika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Ngakamulichisye mwakukulupilichika malajisyo gose ganampele lelojino ga, kuti ntame ni konjecheka, nkombole kwinjila ni kuchijigala chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵalanjile kwakulumbila kwa achachekulu ŵenu kuti champe ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Nkumbuchile iŵatite Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, paŵannongwesye ku ulendo kupitila kuchipululu kwa yaka alobaini, ŵantulwisye ni kunninga kwa isausyo yekulungwa mwelemo, kuti aimanyilile inkuganisya mmitima mwenu ni iŵaga ŵanyamwe tingakamulichisye makanyo gakwe pane ngaŵa. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Ŵantulwisye, ŵantamiche ni sala nambo sooni ŵampele mana kuti nlye, chakulya chinganinchimanyilila ŵanyamwe, atamuno achachekulu ŵenu nganachimanyilila. Ŵatesile yelei kuti anjiganye kuti mundu ngakukola umi ligongo lya yakulya pe, nambo kwa kila liloŵe lya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Pamwaliji mu ulendo wenu kwa yaka alobaini yakuwala yenu nganiiwisala sooni makongolo genu nganigaimba. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Mmanyilileje kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, akunjamuka mpele atati yakuti kunjamuka mwanagwe. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Nipele, ngakamulichisye malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ntendeje mpela yatite pakunnajisya ni kunchimbichisya jwelejo pe. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu chakanjinjisye ŵanyamwe ku chilambo chachili ni chajila, chilambo chachili ni sulo, ni mesi ga uliŵa, ni mesi gagakuulika kwichela ni mmatumbi. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />Chilambo chachili ni mimela jajikuŵilanjikwa ngano, ni shayili, ni misabibu, ni nguju, ni mikomamanga, ni miseituni ni uuchi wejinji. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Kweleko chinkapate yaakulya yejinji na ngansingalilwa chindu. Lwala syakwe syana madini ga isyano, ni mmatumbi gakwe nkukombola kusola madini ga shaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Chinlye ni chinjikute, chimwatogolele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ligongo lya kumpa chilambo chachili ni chajila.”<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu akugombelechekwa akaaliŵalila Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />“Nlolechesye kuti ngankwaliŵalila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwa kulepela kugakamulichisya malajisyo ni makanyo mashalaiti gakwe gangumpa lelojino. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Mwalyaga ni kwikuta ni kutaŵa nyuumba jakusalala ni kutama mwelemo, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />ni katema ng'ombe ni ngondolo syenu, ni sahabu ni feza syenu, ni chindu chachilichose chinkwete pachiipunde kutupa, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />nlilolechesye kuti ngasinlikwesyakwesya ni kwaliŵalila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵaŵankopwesye ku chilambo cha ku Misili, kumwaliji mu ukapolo. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Ŵelewo ni ŵannongwesye kuchipululu chekulungwa chakogoya chila, chachili ni majoka gagakuluma ni makoloto; mwaliji mwangali mesi nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele meesi kutyochela mu lwala lwakulimba kuti nng'we. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Sooni ni uŵampele mana kuti nlye mwipululu mula, chakulya chakanalyeje achachekulu ŵenu. Ŵatesile yeleyi yose kuti antulusye ni ŵanlinjile kwa kumpa isausyo kuti kumbesi ko ampe upile. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Nipele nlilolesesye nkaika kulisalila kuti, ‘Tusichile kwa ukombole ni machili genu twachinsyene.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Nkumbuchile ndaŵi jose kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu wenu, ni ŵakumpa machili ga kusichila. Akutenda yelei kuti akwanilisye lilangano liŵalangene ni achachekulu ŵenu mpela yaili lelojino. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Iŵaga timwaliŵalile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu wenu, ni kujikuya minungu jine ligongo lya kujitumichila ni kujipopelela, ngunjamuka lelojino chinjonasiche. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Naga ngamwapikanila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chinjonasiche mpela ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine iŵatite kwajonanga paujo penu.”<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Ungajitichisya wa ŵandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Kutyoka 32:1-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Ŵanyamwe Ŵaislaeli mpikane! Lelo jino mmandichile komboka lusulo lwa Yolodani, ni kwaula kukuijigala ilambo yaili ni ŵandu ŵajinji ni ŵaali ni machili kumpunda ŵanyamwe. Misi jao jili jekulungwa ni jana makumba galewipe mpaka mwinani. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Ŵandu ŵakwe ali ŵaleu ŵaali ni machili; ŵa uŵelesi wa Ŵaanaki! Mpela inkuti kwamanyilila ni yantite kwapika ŵandu achiŵechetaga kwalumba ŵanyawo kuti, ‘Ŵani ŵachakombole kuputana nawo?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Nipele nyimanyilile lelo kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu channongolele mmbujo nti mooto waukutinisya itela. Ŵelewo chiŵajonanje ŵanyao ni kwaputa paujo penu. Kwayele chimwatopole ni kwajonga kwanakamo, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatile kunlanjila.”<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu pachamale kunkamuchisya kwatopola ŵandu ŵa ilambo yo, nkalisalila mmitima mwenu kuti, ‘Ambuje Akunnungu atujinjisye mu chilambo chi ligongo uweji tuli ŵandu ŵatukupanganya yaikwanonyelesya Akunnungu.’ Ngwamba, Ambuje Akunnungu chiŵatopole ŵandu wo ligongo ali ŵachigongomalo. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Chinkombole kuchitenda chenu chilambo cho ngaŵa kuti nli ŵandu ŵambone pane nkupanganya yaikwanonyelesya Akunnungu, nambo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, akwatopola ŵandu wo paujo penu ligongo ali ŵandu ŵachigongomalo ni akusaka kulitindimisya chilumbilo chiŵaalumbilile achachekulu ŵenu, che Ibulahamu, ni che Isaka ni che Yakubu. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Nipele, mmanyilileje kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akumpa chilambo chachili ni chajila, ngaŵa kuti nkuŵajilwa, ngwamba, pakuŵapo ŵanyamwe nli ŵandu ŵa makani.”<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Nkumbuchile ni ngasindiŵalila imwatite kwachimikasya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kulipululu kula. Pakuŵa kutandilila lyuŵa lila limwakopweche ku Misili mpaka lyuŵa limwaiche pelepa, ŵanyamwe mmele ŵandu unkwagalauka Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Namose patwaliji ku chitumbi cha Holebu kula, mwachimisye kwannope Ambuje Akunnungu, mpaka ŵasachile kunjonanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Panakwesile ku chitumbi kwaula kupochela maganga gagasepekwe mpela ibao yelembekwe lilangano liŵatesile Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵanyamwe, naatemi kweleko moŵa alobaini, muusi ni chilo, nganilyaga atamuno kung'wa chachilichose. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambele ibao iŵili ya maganga yelembekwe ni chala cha Akunnungu; yelembekwe makanyo gose gaŵansalilenje Ambuje Akunnungu kulitumbi kutyochela pa mooto pa lyuŵa lya nsongangano. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Pakumala moŵa alobaini go, muusi ni chilo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambele ibao iŵili ya maganga ilembekwe lilangano.”<verse eid="DEU 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />“Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile kuti, ‘Ntuluche mwitumbi muno chitemachitema, pakuŵa ŵandu ŵenu umwalongwesye kutyoka ku Misili ŵala alyungasiche. Alesile kwachitema litala linaalamwile alikuye, ni kulikolochesya chinyago cha sahabu chakusyana.’”<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />“Sooni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile, ‘Naweni ŵandu ŵa, ali ŵandu ŵamakani nnope. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Nneche najonanje, ni kwatyosya wose akamanyika pachilambo chose. None chinantende mmwe kuŵa atati jwa ŵandu achajinji ŵaali ni machili ni chinanchuluye kwapunda ŵanyawo.’”<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Nipele, nagalawiche, natulwiche kutyochela kuchitumbi, ndili nyigele ibao iŵili ya maganga yelembekwe lilangano, nombe chitumbi chaliji nkukolela mooto. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Panalolite, naiweni kuti ntesile sambi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu; mwamasile kulikolochesya chinyago chakusyana cha ng'ombe ja mwana ja sahabu; kwachitema mwalesile kutenda iŵatite kulajisya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Nipele, paujo penu naiponyisye paasi ibao iŵili ila, naitemangwile nli nkulola. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Nipele nagonile manguku paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, mpela inatesile kundanda, natesile yeleyo kwa moŵa alobaini muusi ni chilo; nganilya chakulya atamuno ni kung'wa meesi, ligongo lya ugongomalo umwautesile paujo pao Ambuje Akunnungu ni kwachimikasya. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Najogwepe lutumbilo lwekulungwa lwa Ambuje Akunnungu kukwenu, ligongo ŵantumbilile kwika mwakunjonanga; nambo kaaŵili Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambikanile sooni. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Nombe, ni ŵaatumbilile nnope che Aluni kwanti kwajonanga; nambo nampopelele che Haluni kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakululuchile katema kakoko. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Achila chindu cha sambi, yaani ajila ng'ombe ja mwana ja sahabu jimwajisyanile, nachijichigele nachitinisye pa mooto, najipondilepondile ni kujisyagasyaga, jaliji mpela luundu lwakwepepala; ni nalusajile nnusulo lwalukwilimisya mesi cha kwichela pa litumbi lyo.”<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />“Iyoyopeyo mwaatumbilikesye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ku Tabela, ni ku Masa ni ku Kibuloti Hataava kula. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Ni katema Ambuje Akunnungu kaŵantumile kuti ntyoche ku Kadeshi Balinea ŵatite, ‘Njaulangane nkachijigale chilambo chingumpa kuti chiŵe chenu,’ nganimwapilikanila; nganimwakulupilila ni sooni mwakanile kugapanganya gaŵansalile. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Ŵanyamwe nli ŵandu unkwagalauka Ambuje Akunnungu chitandilile lyuŵa linammanyilile.”<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“Kwayele une naligwisisye manguku paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu moŵa alobaini, muusi ni chilo, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatite chanjonanje. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Une naapopesile Ambuje Akunnungu njitiji, ‘Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, ngasimwajonanga ŵandu ŵenu umwasagwile ŵa, ŵandu umwawombwele ni kwakoposya ku chilambo cha ku Misili kwa ukombole ni machili genu gamakulungwa. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Mwakumbuchile achikatumetume ŵenu, che Ibulahimu, ni che Isaka, ni che Yakubu, choonde nkagalola makani ni igongomalo ni sambi sya ŵandu ŵa. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Ŵandu ŵa akula ku Misili kumwatutyosisye tachiŵecheta kuti, Ambuje Akunnungu alepele kwajinjisya Ŵaisilaeli ku chilambo chiŵaalanjile, sooni tajile kuti ŵaakopwesye ŵandu ŵao kuti ŵaulaje mu lipululu, pakuŵa ŵachimile. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Pakuŵapo aŵa ali ŵandu ŵenu mwasyene, ŵandu umwakopwesye ku Misili kwa ukombole wenu wekulungwa.’”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Che Musa akupochela sooni malajisyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Kutyoka 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Katema kala, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile, ‘Nsepe ibao iŵili ya maganga mpela yandanda ila, ni lisanduku lya mbao, nipele nnyiche kukwangu akuno ku litumbi kuno. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />None chinembe maloŵe ganalembile mmaganga gandanda gamwatemangwile gala, ni chingaŵiche mu lisanduku mo.’”<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Nipele, nakolosisye lisanduku lya chitela cha nsonobali ni ibao iŵili ya maganga mpela yandanda ila, ni najigele mmakono ni napite nayo kulitumbi. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵalembile pa ibao yo maloŵe galagala giŵalembile pa maganga gandanda gala. Malajisyo kumi gaŵampele ŵanyamwe ndaŵi jaŵaŵechete pa mooto, pa lyuŵa limwasongangene kwitumbi kula. Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambele une ibao yo. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Nagalawiche ni kutuluka ku chitumbi kula, nagaŵisile maganga go mu lisanduku linapanganyisye mpela iŵanajisye Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ili chiŵela mwelemo.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵajendelechele ni ulendo wao kutyochela kuyaliji isima ya ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yaakani ni ŵapite ku Mosela. Kweleko che Haluni ŵawile, ŵasichikwe. Che Eleasali mwanagwe jwachilume, ŵajinjile kuŵa jwambopesi pamalo pakwe. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Kutyochela ku Mosela po, Ŵaisilaeli ŵapite ku Gudigoda, ni ŵapelengenye kwaula ku Yotibata chilambo cha sulo syejinji sya mesi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Katema ko Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasagwile ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Lawi kuti aŵe ŵa kulinyakula Lisanduku lya Malangano, ŵaatumichile Ambuje Akunnungu nti ŵambopesi, ni kwapa upile ŵandu kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu, mpela yaili mpaka lelojino. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Lyele ni ligongo lukosyo lwa Lawi nganapegwa malo jakuŵa jawo mpela iŵatite kupegwa achalongo achinjawo ngosyo sine, chiŵapochele chili luchimbichimbi lwa kuŵa ŵambopesi ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu iŵatite kulanga.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />“Natemi ku chitumbi kwa moŵa alubaini, muusi ni chilo, nti inatesile kuundanda. Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵambikanile, ni sooni ŵakundile kuti ngaŵaajonanga achachekulu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Nipele ŵasalile, ‘Ntyoche njendelechele ni ulendo wenu nli kwalongosya ŵandu kuti ajinjile ni kuchijigala chilambo chinaalumbilile achachekulu ŵenu kuti chinampe.’”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakusaka Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Sambano, ŵanyamwe Ŵaisilaeli, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ngakusaka chachili chose kukwenu, nambo kwajinichila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kugakuya malajisyo gao gose, ni kwanonyela, ni kwatumichila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwa ntima wenu wose ni mbumu jenu jose, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />ni kwitichisya makanyo ni mashalaiti ga Ambuje Akunnungu gingumpanga lelo jino kuti jiŵe mboka jenu mwachimisyene. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Nnole, kwinani, namose kwinani kwakuli kwinani nnope ili yao Ambuje Akunnungu, ni chilambo pano yose yaili mwelemo ili yao. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Namose yeleyo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji ni lung'wanu ni achachekulu ŵenu, ni ŵaanonyele nnope ni kunsagula ŵanyamwe ŵanli iŵelesi yao, kuŵa ŵandu ŵakwe pasikati ja ŵandu wose, nti yaitite kuŵa lelo jino. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Kwayele kutandilila sambano, mwapilikanichisye Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ngasimma ŵandu ŵamakani sooni. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ali Akunnungu ŵa minungu ni Ambuje ŵa achambuje, Ŵelewo ali Akunnungu ŵakulu ŵali ni machili, ni ŵakwajogopa; ŵangali lusagu sooni ngakupochela hongo. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Akwachenjela ŵamalekwa ni achakongwe ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwao; akwanonyela achalendo ŵakutama pasikati jenu ni kwapa yakulya ni yakuwala. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Nipele, mwanonyele achalendo pakuŵa nombe ŵanyamwe mwaliji achalendo ku chilambo cha ku Misili kula. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mwajinichile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ni kwapopelela ŵelewo jikape; nkamulangane nawo kwa kukulupilichika ni nlumbileje kwa liina lyao pe. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Ŵelewo ni ŵakuŵajilwa kwalapa; ni ŵaali Akunnungu ŵenu ni uŵantendele indu yekulungwa ni yakogoya imwalionele mwachinsyene. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Ndaŵi jiŵajaulaga achachekulu ŵenu ku Misili, ŵaliji ŵandu sabiini pe, nambo sano Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, anchulwiye mpela ndondwa sya kumaunde.”<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Che Musa ŵajendelechele kwasalila Ŵaisilaeli kuti, “Kwayele mwanonyele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kugakamulisya mashalaiti gakwe ni makanyo gakwe ni malajisyo gakwe. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Mmanyilileje yakuti lelojino, nganguŵecheta sambano ni ŵanache ŵenu ŵati ngakwimanyilila namose nganaiwona yatite Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwajamuka, ni yatite kuŵa ŵakulu, ŵamachili ni ukombole, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />ni ilosyo yao ni indu yakusimosya iŵaitesile ku Misili kwa mwenye jwa ku Misili ni chilambo chao chose; <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />mwaiweni iŵatite pakwaulaga ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Misili wose, pamo ni falasi syao ni mutuka syao syakukwekwelemwa, iŵatite kwaunichila ni meesi ga mu baali ja Shamu, ni iŵatite Ambuje Akunnungu kwajonanga tikitiki. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Sooni nkumbuchile Ambuje Akunnungu iŵampanganyichisye katema pamwaliji ku lipululu kula mpaka mwaiche apano, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />ni iŵatite pakwapanganyichisya che Datani ni che Abilamu, ŵanache ŵa che Eliabu, mwanagwe che Lubeni. Ndaŵi jo Ŵaisilaeli alinkulilolela, litaka lyaugwiche ni kwamila ŵanyao pamo ni achalongo achinjawo, masakasa gao, inyama ni ŵakutumichila ŵao wose. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Kwa meeso genu mwachinsyene mwaiweni yele indu yekulungwa iŵaitesile Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upile wa chilambo cha lilangano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Kwayele ngapikanichisye makanyo gose gingumpanga lelo jino, kuti nkombole kola machili ga kwinjila ni kuchijigala chilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala pakumala komboka lusulo lwa Yolodani, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />kuti nkatame moŵa gamajinji kuchilambo chachili ni chajila, ni chachikufai kwa ilango ni kulima, chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalumbilile achachekulu ŵenu kuti chiŵape ŵanyawo ni iŵelesi yao. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Pakuŵa chilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala kuŵa chenu ngaŵa nti ku Misili kuntyosile, kwekula mwapandile mbeju mmigunda jenu ni kwitilila meesi kwa makongolo genu mpela mundu yakuti kwitilila migunda ja liponda. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Nambo chilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala kuŵa chenu pakumala komboka lusulo lwa Yolodani, chili cha matumbi ni machemba, chilambo chachikunya ula jajikutyochela kwinani, <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />chilambo chaakuchigosa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni sooni Ambuje Akunnungu akuchilolechesya moŵa gose kutandilila ndandililo ja chaka mpaka kumbesi chaka.”<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Nipele, naga tingapilikanile kwa kukulupilichika makanyo gingumpanga lelo jino, iŵaga chimwanonyele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kwatumichila kwa ntima wenu wose ni mbumu syenu syose, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />Ambuje Akunnungu wo, tajitende ula jinye mu chilambo chenu mundaŵi ja kusosekwa, ula ja chisimaupya ni ula ja chuuku ni ŵanyamwe chinchigungula yakulya yenu, ni divai jasambano ni mauta. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Chagamesye masamba ga kuliisisisya ng'ombe syenu, nombe ŵanyamwe tinlye ni kwikuta. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Nlilolechesye nkaika kulambuswa, kwaleka Ambuje Akunnungu kwaula kujitumichila minnungu jine ni kujipopelela. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Mwatendaga yeleyo Ambuje Akunnungu chantumbilile, ni kugataŵa maunde kuti jikanya ula sooni, ni pachilambo ŵandu chalepele kupata magungulo, chinjonasiche chitema mu chilambo chachili ni chajila chakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />“Ngaŵiche maloŵe ga mmitima mwenu ni ngaganichisye. Ngataŵe mmakono mwenu nti chimanyisyo ni kugataŵa pausyo penu gankumbuchisye. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Mwajiganye ŵanache ŵenu maloŵe ga. Chimwatanjile pachintame pamusi pane mu ulendo pane pankupumulila atamuno pankupanganya masengo. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Ngalembe mu felemu sya minango jenu ni mu milango jekulungwa jakwinjilila mu misi jenu. <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />Mwatendaga yeleyo, ŵanyamwe ni ŵanache ŵenu chintame moŵa gamajinji ku chilambo chiŵalumbilile Ambuje Akunnugu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwapa achachekulu ŵenu, mpela kwiunde kwakukuti kutamilichisya moŵa gamajinji penani pa chilambo.”<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Nkamulisye yambone malajisyo gose gingumpanga: Kunnonyela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kuitendekanya yose yakuisaka ni kukamulangana nawo mmatala gawo gose. <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu chiŵatopole ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine atyoche paujo penu, nombe ŵanyamwe chinjigale kuti iŵe yenu, ilambo ya ŵandu ŵajinji ni ŵaali ni machili kumpunda ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Malo jilijose jichindiŵate kwa sajo syenu chijiŵe jenu; chilambo chose chichijenele kutandilila kwipululu, chakulujenda, mpaka kumatumbi ga ku Lebanoni chakumpoto, kutyochela kulusulo lwa Efulate chakungopochelo lyuŵa, mpaka ku bahali ja Meditelania jajili kulikuswela lyuŵa. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Ngapagwa mundu jwalijose juchakombole kunsiŵilila. Malo jilijose jichinjaule nkati chilambo cho, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chiŵatendekasye ŵandu kuti anjogope ŵanyamwe mpela iŵatite kulanga.”<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Nlole, lelo jino ngumpanga nsagule pasikati ja upile ni malweso: <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Iŵaga tingapilikanichisye makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu gingumpanga lelojino chimpate upile; <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />ni iŵaga ngankugapilikanichisya makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, sooni iŵaga nkulileka litala lingunlamulila, ni kujipopelela minungu jine janganinjimanyilila chitandilile kalakala chinnesweche. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Ambuje Akunnungu pachanyichisye ku chilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala kuŵa chenu, chinkatangasye upile kutyochela pa litumbi lya Gelisimu, ni malweso kutyochela pa litumbi lya Ebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Matumbi gaŵili ga gali kumaswelelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani, ku chilambo cha Ŵakanaani ŵakutama ku lichemba lya lusulo lwa Yolodani, chiŵandi ni musi wa ku Giligali, ngaŵa kwakutalika ni itela ya mwaloni. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Chinjomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kwinjila kuchijigala chilambo ni kuchitenda chiŵe chenu chakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. Nipele, pachinkatame mu chilambo mo ni kuchitenda chenu, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />choonde nlolechesye kuti nkugapikanila mashalaiti gose ni malajisyo gingumpa lelo.”<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Liuto limo pe lya kupopelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Che Musa ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta, “Agano ni makanyo ni malajisyo ni mashalaiti gachinkagapanganye ku chilambo chakumpanga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa achachekulu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu, kwa moŵa gose gachinkatame mu chilambo mo. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Ngumule kusyenesyene mwakusimanilana kujipopelela milungu jao yaŵaga mmatumbi gamaleu, pane mu ikwesya ni kuusi itela yaili ni mbwilili wekulungwa. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Nkaigumule ilisa yao ni kugakasanya maganga gawo gakugapopelela. Ntinisye kwa mooto njanamila sya nnungu jwankongwe jwakuŵilanjikwa Ashela, ni nkaikatanyekatanye inyago yao yakusepa ni kugasimasya mena ga minungu jao pa malo po.”<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Atamuno ngasimwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, mpela yakuti kujipopelela minungu jao. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Nambo tinjaule pa liuto patapasagule Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, mu ngosyo syose kuti alikondesye liina lyao, sooni kuti paŵe malo gakwe, kweleko ni kuchinkajaule. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Kweleko chinkapeleche mbopesi syenu syakutinisya ni sadaka sya chijama ni liunjili lya kakumi ni sadaka sya nasili ni sadaka sya michango ni sadaka syankupeleka pangankanganisisya ni mmeleko waandanda wa ng'ombe ni ngondolo syenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Kweleko, chinkalye paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chinkalye ni kusengwe pamo ni ŵa pannango penu indu yambone yejinji yampele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu pakumala kupanganya masengo.”<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Ngasintenda nti yankuti kutenda lelo jino, mundu jwalijose akulitendela yakuti kusaka nsyene, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />pakuŵa chiŵela nganinjinjile pa chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akumpa chiŵe chenu kuti nkatame kwa chitendewele. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Nambo patinjomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kwaula kuchijigala chilambo chakumpanga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu, tantendekasye ntame kwa kutulala, pangansausya ŵammagongo ŵenu wose ŵatansyungulile kuti ntameje kwa chitendewele. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Nipele pamalo pati Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, tapasagule kuti ŵandu ŵapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu, pelepo ni pachimpeleche chindu chachili chose chitannamulile: Mbopesi syenu syakutinisya ni sadaka sya chijama ni liunjili lya kakumi ni sadaka sya nasili ni sadaka sya michango ni sadaka syankupeleka pangankanganisisya ni mmeleko wa ndanda wa ng'ombe ni ngondolo syenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Nkaŵeje ŵandu ŵakusangalala paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, pamo ni ŵanache ŵenu ŵa chilume ni ŵa chikongwe, ŵakutumichila ŵenu, ni Ŵalawi ŵakutama pa misi jenu, pakuŵa ŵanyao nganakola lisi lyachiliŵe lyao. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Ndilolechesye ngasinjaula kupeleka mbopesi syenu sya kutinisya pa malo jakulisosela mwachinsyene. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Nambo pa malo patapasagule Ambuje Akunnungu pasikati lukosyo lumo mu ngosyo syenu. Pelepo ni pachinkapeleche sadaka syenu sya kutinisya, sooni ni pachinkatendele yosepe inannamulile.”<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Nambo ngankulekaswa kusikita ni kulya inyama yenu mmisi muchinkatame mo. Nkalyeje nyama muchinkasachile, kutyochela mu inyama mpela ichimpate upile ni Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵandu wose nkalyeje, ŵangakukundikwa ni ŵakukundikwa paujo pa Akunnungu, nkalyeje mpela inkuti kulya ndandala pane mbaŵala. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Nambo ngasinlya myasi ja inyama yo; nkajijite pasi mpela meesi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Nkaliila mmisi jenu sadaka sya liunjili lya kakumi lya magungulo genu, ni ja divai jenu, ni ja mauta genu, ni ja mmeleko waandanda wa ng'ombe ni ngondolo syenu, ni sadaka syenu sya nasili pane syankupeleka pangankanganichisya, namose yakwapelechela ineine. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Pamalo pakwe nkalyeje yakupeleka yo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu pamalo patapasagule Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu: ŵanyamwe ni ŵanache ŵenu achakongwe ni achalume ni ŵakutumichila ŵenu achakongwe ni achalume pamo ni Ŵalawi ŵakutama mu misi jenu. Nlisengwasye paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu kwa yose yampele. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Nkalilolesesye kuti, ndaŵi jose jichinkatame nchilambomo, ngasinjenda kwaliŵalila Ŵalawi.”<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, patakachikusye chilambo chenu mpela iŵatite kunlanjila. Naga chinkaŵe ni lukowo lwa kulya nyama ni nkusaka kulya nyama, nkukomboleka kulya munkusachila. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Naga malo jitajisagule Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kuti ŵandu ajaule akaapopelele kwaŵaga kutaliche, nkukombola kusikita ng'ombe pane ngondolo jwalijose jwampele Ambuje Akunnungu, mpela inatite pakunsalila kuti nkukombola kulya nyama jo munkusachila mmisi jenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Chinlye nyama jo mpela yaikuti kuligwa ndandala ni mbaŵala. Mundu jwalijose jwakukundikwa ni jwangakundikwa paujo pa Akunnungu, akukombola kulya. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Nambo nlilolechesye ngasinlya myasi, pakuŵa myasi jili umi; nipele ngasinlya myasi pamo ni nyama. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Ngasinlya myasi jo, nambo njijite pasi mpela meesi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Nkalya myasi, kuti indu yenu pamo ni uŵelesi wenu inkondele, pakuŵa nkutenda yambone paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Indu yammiisile ligongo lya Ambuje yachimpeleche ni sadaka syenu sya nasili, chinsijigale ni kusipeleka pa malo patapasagule Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Njisenawo mbopesi sya kutinisya, pachilisa cha Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nyama ni myasi jakwe. Iyoyo ni sadaka sine syati chinchilya nyama jakwe, myasi jakwe chinjitile mu mbali mwa chilisa. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Nlilolesesye kuikamulisya ayi inunnamulila yi kuti indu yenu injendechele yambone ŵanyamwe pamo ni uŵelesi ŵenu moŵa gangali mbesi, pakuŵa chintende chachili chambone ni chausyene paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo ga kupopelela inyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, tiŵajonanje kusyene ŵandu ŵa ilambo inkuŵandichila kwinjila ni kwatyosa. Nambo pachimwatopole ni kutama mu chilambo chao, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />nlilolesesye ngansinditanjisya kwa kugakuya matala gao ga kupopelela minungu jao. Nkalinga kuuchilichisya yankati minungu jao, nchitiji ‘Ŵandu ŵa ŵapopelelega chinauli milungu jao? Noweji tutende iyoyo.’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Ngasimwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, mpela ŵanyawo yakuti kwapopelela nnungu jwawo, pakuŵa pakujipopelela minungu jao akuitendekanya indu yaikwachimikasya Ambuje Akunnungu atamuno akwachoma pa mooto ŵananche ŵao ŵa chilume ni ŵachikongwe, mpela sadaka kwa minungu jao.”<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Nlilolechesye kuti nkupanganya yose ingunnamulila; ngasinjonjechesya chachilichose namose nkapungusya.”<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Pasikati jenu apagwaga jwaakulondola kwalitala lya sagamisi, ni kunsalila ilosyo ni yakusimosya, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />kanyuma, ilosyo ni yakusimosya yo yakopochelaga, ni jwakulondola jo ajilaga kuti: ‘Tujikuye minungu jine ni kujitumichila, minungu jinganinjipopelele’, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />ngasimpikanila maloŵe ga jwele jwakulondola jwakusagamukula sagamisi jo. Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akunlinga ŵanyamwe kuti aimanye kuti iŵaga nkwanonyela kwa mtima wenu wose ni kwa mbumu jenu jose. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Njende nlikwakuya ni kwachimbichisya kwa nnope Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kugakamulisya makanyo gao ni kwajitichisya maloŵe gao; mwatumichile ni kukamulana nao moŵa gose. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Nambo Jwakulondola jwakusagamukula kwa litala lya sagamisi jo chaulajikwe, pakuŵa chiiŵe ŵajiganyisye ŵandu ŵakanile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵaŵankopwesye ku chilambo cha Misili ni kummombola kutyochela mu ukapolo. Jwakulondola jo akusaka nlileche litala lyati Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akusaka nlikuye. Yeleyo ni ichinjile pakuuityosya yachigongomalo pasikati jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Naga mpwenu jwa Lutumbo lumo, pane mwanagwenu jwa chilume pane jwa chikongwe, pane ŵankwenu ŵankwasaka nnope, pane achikudi ŵenu, chanchisye kwa chisyepela alinkuti, ‘Tujaule tukajipopelele minungu jine’, minungu jati mmwe atamuno achachekulu ŵenu ngankujimanyilila, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />minungu ja ŵandu ŵakunsyngula, pane minungu jine ja ŵandu ŵakutalika kutyochela kuundanda kwa chilambo mpaka kuumbesi kwa chilambo, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />ngasimwajitichisya, namose kwapikanila pane kwakolela chanasa pane kwalechelela namose kwasisa. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Nambo chimwaulaje. Mmwejo chimme ŵaandanda pa kwaulaga, nipele chaakuye ŵandu ŵane. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mwapute ni matupi mpaka awe! Ligongo ŵannyenjile kuti mwaleche Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, uŵankopwese mu ukapolo ku chilambo cha ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Nipele, Ŵaisilaeli wose chapikane sooni chajogope, ngaatenda yachigongomalo yanti yeleyo.”<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />“Pachinkatame mmisi jakumpanga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni mwapikanaga kuti, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />apali ŵandu ŵakunlyungasya pasikati jenu, akwanyenga ŵandu ŵa mmisi jo achisalaga kuti, ‘Tujaule tukajipopelele minungu jine,’ minungu jingankujimanyilila, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />nipele nkauchilichisye ni kuimanyilichisya yambone; ni iŵaga ili yaisyene kuti chipali chindu chakuchimikasya chipanganyikwe pasikati jenu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />ikusachilwa ŵandu ŵa musi wo aulajikwe kwa upanga chimuujonanje musi wo ni kila chindu chachili mwelemo ni ilango yao yose. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Indu yose imwasumwile chimuikumbikanye pamo ni kuiŵika paluŵala lwa musi wo ni chinchichoma mooto nti sadaka sya kutinisya kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu; kwa moŵa gangali mbesi, musi wo chiusigalile masame, ni ngautaŵikwa ng'oo. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Ngasinjigala chachilichose chachipelechekwe kuchitinisya, kuti Ambuje Akunnungu aleche chisongolo chakwe, ni ammonele chanasa ni kunchuluya nnope mpela iŵatite kwalanjila achachekulu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />Yeleyo chiikopochele, iŵaga chimwajitichisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kugakamulisyaga makanyo gao gose gingumpa lelo jino ga, ni kutenda yaikukundikwa paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Chisyoŵelelo cha kulila kwa malumbo kwakukukanikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Ŵanyamwe nli ŵanache ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nkalilembalemba pane kumyola lupala ligongo lya mundu jwawile. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Ŵanyamwe nli ŵandu ŵakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni Ambuje Akunnungu ansagwile ŵanyamwe pasikati ja ŵandu ŵane ŵa pachilambo kuti mme ŵandu ŵakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyama yaikukanikwa kuligwa ni yangaikukanikwa kuligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Ŵalawi 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Ngasinlya chindu chachilichose changachikukundikwa pa kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Inyama yi ni inchilye: Ngo'mbe, ngondolo ni mbusi, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />ndope ni ngolombwe ni mbaŵala ni ndogolo ni mbaŵe. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Chinyama chachili ni ikotwa yeŵaluche kaŵili ni chachikuchukula nkukombola kulya. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Nambo ngasinlya chinyama chachilichose chati ikotwa yakwe yanganiŵaluka kaŵili ni sooni ngaikuchukula, ngasinlya ngamia, ni kalunga ni njechele. Inyama yo ikuchukula nambo ikotwa yakwe nganiiŵaluka, yeleyo ngaikukundikwa pa kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Nombe liguluŵe pakuŵa atamuno lili ni ikotwa yeŵalwiche nambo ngalikuchukula, yeleyo ngaikukundikwa pa kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. Ngasinlya nyama jakwe namose kujikwaya mitembo jao.”<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Yepanganyikwe yaikutama mmeesi nkukombola kulya chachili ni ipyepye ni makalaŵesya. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Nambo yanganiikola ipyepye ni makalaŵesya ngasinlya ikanyichikwe kukwenu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Nkukombola kulya ijuni yanganiikanichikwa kulya kukwenu. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Nambo nkalya, litumbusi ni lisonombela ni kapungu, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />nakanje ni itotola ya uŵele wose <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />makungulu ga uŵele wose, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />mbuni ni nalumbapala ni litipitipi ni kasinga ya uŵele wose, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />liundi lyamwana ni chisyantima ni liititi, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />maloya ni lipupilambugu ni mnandi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />katilili ni chankoma kwa uŵele wao wose ni chipupupu ni lichinji.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />“Idudu yose yaikukwaŵa yaili ni mapapiko ngaikukundikwa pa kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu, ngasinlya. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Nambo yepanganyikwe yose yaili ni mapapiko yanganiikaanyichikwa nkukombola kulya.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />“Nkalya ibudu, nkukombola kumpa jwannendo jwakutama pasikati jenu pane kunsumichisya mundu jwa chilambo chine, pakuŵa mmwe ndi ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">“Nkakateleka kambusi kwa maŵele ga nangolo jwakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilajisyo lyankati liunjili lyakakumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Mmiche pambali liunjli lyakakumi kutyochela mmagoŵolo gose ga mmigunda mwenu pa kila chaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Nipele njaulanje peuto patapasagule Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kuti nkaapopelele, pachimme paujo pakwe chinlyanje liunjili lyakakumi lya magowolo genu ni ja divai jasambano ni ja mbeju sya seituni ni ja ipago yandanda ya ng'ombe ni ngondolo syenu. Ntendeje yeleyo kuti nlijiganye kwachimbichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu moŵa gose. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Iŵaga liuto lyasagwile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti nkaapopelele lili kwatalichila ni ŵanyamwe, ni nkulepela kujigala liunjili lyakakumi lya magungulo genu, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ampele yejinji nnope, pelepo ntende nyi: <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />Nsumisye liunjili lyakakumi lyo ni mbiya syakwe njaule nasyo peuto patapasagule Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kwapopelela. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Mbiya syo nsumile chilichose chachikulajila ntima, pane ng'ombe pane ngondolo pane divai pane nkologo pane inkuisaka mu ntima wenu. Nomwe chinlye paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nsangalale mmwe ni ŵamunyuumba jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />“Nkaaliŵalila Ŵalawi ŵaali pasikati ja misi jenu pakuŵa ŵanyawo nganakola lisi lyao achinsyene. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Kumbesi kwa kila chaka chaatatu mmiche pambali liunjili lyakakumi lya magowolo ga chaka cho ni kujigosa mu misi jenu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Yele chiiŵe kwaligongo lya Ŵalawi pakuŵa nganakola lisi lyao achinsyene, ni achalendo ni ŵamalekwa ni achakongwe ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo ŵaakutama mmisi jenu, alyeje ni kwikuta. Ntendeje yeleyo nomwe chinkole upile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwa masengo ginkugapanganya kwa makono genu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Chaka cha saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Ŵalawi 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Kumbesi kwa kila chaka cha saba mwalechelesye ŵammagambo ŵenu wose. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Chintende chanchiti nyi: Jwalijose jwakukongosya, talechelesye chankongwesye Mwisilaeli njakwe. Akalinga kwadai pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu asyene alamwile kuti ligambo lyo lilechelelwe. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Nkukombola kwadai achalendo nambo magambo ga Mwisilaeli njenu chinchigalechelela.”<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“Ngaapagwa jwakulaga pasikati jenu pakuŵa mu chilambo chaakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu chaachimpa upile kwannope. <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />Chimpochele upile wo iŵaga chimunjitichisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kusyene ni kugakuya malajisyo gingumpa lelo jino. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu chachimpa upile mpela iŵatite kunlanjila ŵanyamwe, ni ŵanyamwe chinchaakongosya ŵandu ŵa ilambo yejinji nambo mwachinsyene ngankongola kwa mundu jwalijose. Chintawale ilambo yejinji nambo mmwe ngaaika kukuntawala.”<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Apagwaga jwakulaga pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli achinjenu mmusi wauliwose wa chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, akumpa nkautenda mtima wenu kuŵa wakulimba ni kulepela kunkamuchisya Mwisilaeli njenu jwaali jwakulaga. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Nambo mmeje ni mitima jambone, mwakongosye kwa usache wenu chindu chilichose yaikwasoŵa. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Nlilolechesye nkakana kwakongosya Ŵaisilaeli achinjenu kwa kuganichisya mumtima mwenu kuti, chaka cha kulechelela magambo chikuŵandichila. Nkalechela nganisyo sya chigongomalo go ganjinjile. Pakuŵa iŵaga nkunkana kunkongosya nombejo andililaga Ambuje Akunnungu nkati mmwe, chinchiŵa ni sambi. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mwape kwa mitima jambone pangali ligogo, pakuŵa kwakutenda yeleyo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu champe upile mmwe mmasengo genu gose ni kwa indu yose ichimpanganye kwa nkono wenu. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Ŵakulaga chaaŵe moŵa gose mu chilambo chi. Ngunlajisya mwapeje yaikwasoŵa, ŵakulaga ni achalongo ŵenu kwa mtima wambone.”<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakuti kwatendela achikapolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Kutyoka 21:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Iŵaga Mwisilaeli njenu jwannume pane jwankongwe alisumisye kukwenu ni kuntumichila yaka sita, pachaka cha saba ikusachilwa munneche ajaule ali alechelelwe. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Nombe mmwe mwalechelelaga nkanleka atyoche makonope. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Mwape kwa mtima wambone achila champele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kwa upile, mpela ila ngondolo ni magowolo ni divai. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Nkumbuchileje kuti ŵanyamwe mwaliji achikapolo ku chilambo cha ku Misili, ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ŵammwombwele. Lyelelyo ni ligongo ngunlajisya indu yi lelo jino.”<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />“Nambo kapolo jwenu ajilaga kuti ngaakusaka kunneka akunnonyela mmwe ni ŵapannango wenu ni akulipikana yambone kutama ni ŵanyamwe, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />nipele munjigale kapolo jo mpaka pannango, chinjigale nsomelo ni kwatoga liwiwi mpaka nsomelo wo chiujinjile mu chibao cha pannango, nombejo chaŵe kapolo jwenu mu umi wakwe wose. Muntendele iyoyo ni kapolo jwenu jwankongwe. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Nkaganisya kuti ikulema kunnechelela kapolo jwenu, pakuŵa antumichile yaka sita, kwa nusu ja malipilo, akaliji jwakutumichila jwakwapa malipilo, ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu champe upile mmwe mu yose ichinyitende.”<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmeleko waandanda wa ilango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Mumpelechele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu iŵeleko yaandanda yose yaili mikambaku ya mipingo ja ng'ombe ni ngondolo. Nkasitendekasya masengo ng'ombe syo, ni nkasikata manyunya ngondolo syo. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kila chaka chinchilya inyama yo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu peuto patansagulile Ambuje Akunnungu, mmwe ni ŵamunyuumba jenu. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Iŵaga chinyama china chilema pane alemele pane ngakulola pane kulemala kwakwe kupundile, nkachityosya chisikitwe kuŵa mbopesi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Nkukombola kulya inyama yanti yeleyo mmisi jenu jinkutama. Ŵandu ŵanawose pasikati jenu, ŵangakundikwa ni ŵakundikwe paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, nkukombola kulya mpela munkulila ndandala pane mbaŵala. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Nambo nkanlya myasi jakwe, njijitile myasi jo paasi nti meesi.”<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kutyoka 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Munchimbichisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwa kuntendela chindimba cha Pasaka pa mwesi wa Abibu, yaani mwesi waandanda wa chaka, pakuŵa pa mwesi wo ŵantyosisye ku Misili katema ka chilo. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Chinchityosya mbopesi ja Pasaka kutyochela mu ilango yenu ya ngondolo ni ng'ombe peuto patachisagula Ambuje Akunnungu kuti paŵe malo ga kwapopelela. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Nkalya nyama jo ni mikate jetaje amila kwapamo. Mmoŵa saba chinchilya mikate jangataga amila, jele mikate jo jikuŵilanjikwa mikate ja masauko pakuŵa mwatyosile ku Misili mwakwanguya, kwayele, moŵa gose pachintame chinkumbuchile lyuŵa limwatyosile ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Jikapagwa amila mu chilambo chenu mmoŵa saba. Nyama jajilijose jichinjityose mbopesi ligulo lya lyuŵa lyandanda nkajisigasya mpaka kundaŵi.”<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“Nkatyochesya mbopesi ja Pasaka mu musi wauliwose wampele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />ikaŵe malo gati asagwile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kuti gawe malo ga kumpopelela. Pelepo ni pachintyose mbopesi ja Pasaka, ligulo katema kalikutiŵila lyuŵa, katema kalakala kamwatyosile ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Nteleche nyama jo ni kulila pamalo paasagwile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kundaŵi jakwe chimmuje ku chigono kwenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Mmoŵa sita chinchilya mikate jangataga amila ni palyuŵa lya saba ntende nsongangano kwaligongo lya kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni nkapanganya masengo galigose pa lyuŵa lyo.”<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chindimba cha magungulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:2">Kutyoka 34:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Ŵalawi 23:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Mmalanje ijuma saba kutyochela pankutanda kugungula magowolo. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Nipele ntende Chindimba cha Ijuma kwa luchimbichimbi lwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwa kwatyochesya sadaka kwa usache wenu malinga ni intite kupegwa upile ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Njangale paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵanyamwe ni achachanda ŵenu ni achiŵali ŵenu ni achikapolo ŵenu ni ŵakutumichila ŵenu ni Ŵalawi ŵali mu misi jenu ni achalendo ni ŵamalekwa pamo ni achakongwe ŵawililwe ni ŵankwakwe ŵaali pasikati jenu. Nkatende yeleyo pamalo patasagule Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti mwapopelele. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Nkumbuchile kuti mwaliji achikapolo ku Misili, nipele ngajitichisye malajisyo ga kwakulilochesya.”<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chindimba cha masakasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Ŵalawi 23:33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Kila chaka pachimmale kugasonganganya magowolo genu ni kuminya sabibu syenu, ntende Chindimba cha Masakasa kwa moŵa saba. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Njangale mu chindimba cho, ŵanyamwe ni achachanda ŵenu ni achiŵali ŵenu ni achikapolo ŵenu pamo ni ŵakutumichila ŵenu, ni Ŵalawi ni achalendo pamo ni ŵamalekwa ni achakongwe ŵaŵililwe ni achiŵankwawo ŵaali mu misi jenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa moŵa saba chintende chindimba chakunchimbichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu pa malo patapasagule Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tachimpa upile mmagowolo genu ni mmasengo gankugapanganya kwa makono genu, ni pelepo kusengwa kwenu tikumalile.”<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Kila jwannume taachika katatu pachaka paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, pamalo patapasagule, ku Chindimba cha Mikate jangataga amila ni ku Chindimba cha Ijuma ni ku Chindimba cha Masakasa. Mundu jwalijose akaika makono pe paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Kila mundu atyosye yakuti kukombola, malinga ni yatite kupegwa upile ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakuti kulamula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Chinsagule ŵakulamula ni achikamusi ŵao pa kila lukosyo, mu misi jose jakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nombewo chiŵalamule ŵandu pangali lusagu. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Nlamule yaikuti kusachilwa namose kutenda lusagu. Nkapochela hongo pakuŵa jelejo jikwataga chiputa ŵandu ŵaali ni lunda ni kwatendekasya ŵakulamula alamule yangaikusachilwa kwa ŵandu ŵangali chileŵo. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Nlamule ni kuikuya yakuisaka Akunnugu pe, kuti nkatame ni kuchitenda chenu chilambo chakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />“Pachintaŵe chilisa chakutyochesya mbopesi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nkachijimika chiŵandi pao chinyago cha nnungu jwankongwe Ashela. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Namose nkajimika chanamila sya liganga kwaligongo lya kujipopelela minungu, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, akusichima chanamila syo.”<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Nkajisikita ng'ombe pane ngondolo jajili ni chilema pane dosali, ni kuntyochesya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuŵa mbopesi pakuŵa ili uchimwa kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“Iŵaga jwannume pane jwankongwe jwakutama pasikati ja misi jenu jakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu awoneche ali nkutenda chigongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwa ungajitichisya Lilangano lyakwe, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />nombejo ajawile kukutumichila minungu jine ni kupopelela iŵeje lyuŵa ni mwesi pane indu ine ya kwinani yanganinajisya nnyipopelele, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />mundu ansalilaga nkati ngani jo, pelepo mmuchilichisye chenene. Iŵaga kusyene chindu chauchimwa cho chitendekwe pasikati ja ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />pelepo munjigale jwannume jo pane jwankongwe jwatesile chigongomalo cho, munjausye paasa musi, kweleko nkaaponyele maganga mpaka awe. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Nambo mundu jo taulajikwe kwa umboni wa ŵandu ŵaŵili pane ŵatatu, ngapagwa mundu jutaulajikwe kwa umboni wa mundu jumo pe. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Ŵandu ŵatyosisye umboni aŵe ŵaandanda kumputa kwa maganga mundu jo, pelepo ni akuyeje ŵane. Kwanti yele chimuutyosye ugongomalo pasikati jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Gakopochelaga magambo mu misi jenu, ni gaŵaga gakulimba nnope mpaka nkulepela kugalamula, mpela ila magambo gakuulagana kwa mele pane ngaŵa kwa mele, pane magambo gankati indu yaikusachilwa kupegwa ŵandu pane kuulasyana. Yakopochelaga yeleyo, mpelecheje peuto patapasagule Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Njaule kwa Ŵambopesi yaani Ŵalawi, ni kwa jwakulamula jutachiwa mmasengo kele katema ko, nombe ŵanyawo chagalamule magambo genu. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Ntendeje malinga ni itansalile kwele kwiuto kwasagwile Ambuje Akunnungu. Npanganye yose mpela ichinnajiswe. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Ntendeje malinga ni malajisyo gatanjiganye ni malamulo gatansalile. Nkalinga kugalausya malamusi go kwa litala lyalililyose. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Mundu jwalijose jwangakunjitichisya jwambopesi jwaali mmasengo gakwatumichila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu pane jwakulamula, mundu jo taulajikwe, ni kwanti yele chimuutyosye ugongomalo pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Ŵandu wose taipikane ni kogopa, nombe ngapagwa mundu jutalinje kuitendekanya yanti yeleyo sooni.”<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malajisyo kwagamba mamwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />Che Musa ŵajendelechele kwasalila Ŵaisilaeli kuti, “Pachinjinjile mu chilambo chaakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kuti chiŵe chenu, ni kutama mwelemo, mwatiji; tukusaka tukole mwenye nti ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine yaikutusyungula, <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />nlilolechesye kuti jwele mundu jutimunsagule aŵe mwenye jwenu aŵeje jwasagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. Mundu jo aŵeje akutyochela mu ngosyo syenu. Nkansagula jwannendo jwanganaŵa Mwisilaeli aŵe mwenye jwenu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Mwenye jo akakola falasi syesijinji kwaligongo lyakwe nsyene, namose kwausya ŵandu ku Misili kuti akole falasi syesijinji, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatite kuti ŵandu ŵakwe ngasaujila kweleko sooni. <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Akalombela achakongwe ŵajinji kuti ntima wakwe ukalyungasika ni kwaleka Ambuje Akunnungu, namose akalisalachisya madini ga feza ni sahabu syesijinji. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Pele patachiŵa mwenye, alilembele chitabu chine kwaligongo lyakwe nsyene chachikutyochela ni achila chitabu cha malajisyo chachikugosekwa ni ŵambopesi waali Ŵalawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Chitabu cho chichiŵe chiŵandi nao, achisyome moŵa gose mu umi ŵakwe, kuti akombole kulijiganya yakuti kwachimbichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵakwe, ni kugajitichisya maloŵe gose ga malajisyo ni makanyo gakwe. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Malajisyo go chigaakamusye kuti akalikwesya kwa Ŵaisilaeli achinjakwe ni kugalyungasya. Pelepo jwelejo ni uŵelesi wakwe tajendelechele kuŵa mamwenye kwa Ŵaisilaeli moŵa gose.”<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Liunjili lya ŵambopesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Ŵambopesi ŵaali Ŵalawi ni lukosyo lose lwa Ŵalawi, ngaapegwa lisi kuti liŵe lyao mu chilambo cha ku Isilaeli. Ŵanyawo tachitama ali nkulya mbopesi ni sadaka sine syasikutyochekwa kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Kwayele ŵanyawo ngapengwa lisi kuti liŵe lyao mpela ngosyo sine sya Ŵaisilaeli syasitite kupegwa, yaikwaŵajila ŵanyawo kuli kuŵa ŵambopesi ŵa Akunnungu mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalanjila.”<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Ŵandu pakutyosa sadaka iŵeje ng'ombe pane ngondolo, ŵambopesi chapegwe lukongolo lwa mbujo ni chimbundi ni matuumbo nti liunjili lyao. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Chinchapa milimbu ja magungulo genu ni ja divai jasambano ni ja mauta ga mseituni, ni manyunya ga ngondolo gankugakata kaandanda. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Pakuŵa kutyochela mu ngosyo syenu syosye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu asagwile lukosyo lwa Ŵalawi litumiche mpela ŵambopesi moŵa gose pangali mbesi.”<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Iŵaga Mlawi asachile nsyene akukombola kutyoka ku musi wauliwose wa Ŵaisilaeli ni kwaula akula kwakusagwile Akunnungu kuti ŵaapopelele, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />pelepo akukombola kwatumichila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵakwe nti Ŵalawi ŵane yakuti kwatumichila Ambuje Akunnungu kweleko. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Tachipochela yalumo liunjili lya yakulya mpela yakuti kupochela ŵambopesi ŵane, namose akwete mbiya syakupata kwakusapulilwa ni achalongo achinjawo pakusumisya indu yao.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo nkati masyoŵelelo ga chilendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Pachinjinjile mu chilambo chaakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nkalijiganya kuitendekanya indu ya uchimwa kutyochela kwa ŵandu ŵa ilambo yo. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Ngasawoneka mundu jwalijose pasikati jenu jwakuntyosya mbopesi jakutinisya nchanda jwakwe pane mwali jwakwe pa mooto wa pa chilisa, pane jwachisango pane jwakusagamukula indu yakatema pane jwausaŵi, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />namose jwakuloga pane jwa majiini pane jwakugapopelela masoka pane jwakwaŵenda ŵandu ŵawile. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Mundu jwalijose jutaitendekanye indu yi ali uchimwa kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kwaligongo lya yele indu yauchimwa yo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, akwatopola ŵandu ŵa ilambo yo mbujo mwenu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Mme ŵakukulupilichika kwannope paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilanga cha kwaikanawo Jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Nipele che Musa ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta kuti, “Ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine uchinchiijigala ilambo yao iŵe yenu akwapikanila ŵandu ŵakulondola ni ŵachisango. Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ankanyisye ŵanyamwe kuitendekanya yele indu yo. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, tachinsagulila jwakulondola mpela une pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli achinjenu, mumpikanileje jwelejo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Mpela imwaachondelele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ku Sinai kula, pa lyuŵa limwasongangene nchitiji, ‘Tukalipikana liloŵe lya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu namose kuuwona mooto wekulungwa wu sooni, tukaika kuwa.’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatite, ‘Chaakusala chili chisyene. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Chinaasagulile jwakulondola mpela mmwe pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli achinjawo, chinjasalila chakusala, nombewo chachaasalila inayose ichinjalajisya. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Iŵaga jwalijose ngaagapikanila maloŵe ga jwakulondola gatinaasalile aŵechete, chinjimputa nansyene. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Nambo jwakulondola juchaŵechete chindu chilichose chinganinalajisya asale, pane kuŵecheta chindu chaasalilwe ni minungu jine, jwakulondola jo chaulajikwe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Nambo ŵanyamwe nkukombola kuliusya, chinkombole chinauli kwimanyilila kuti liloŵe li nganilityochela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu? <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Iŵaga jwakulondola chaaŵechete chindu achitiji, ‘Ambuje Akunnungu asasile,’ naga chindu cho ngachikutyochela pane ngaŵa cha usyene, chindu cho nganasala Ambuje Akunnungu. Jwakulondola jo aŵechete yeleyo kwa chibuli, ni ŵanyamwe nkanjogopa mundu jo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Misi jakuutuchila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Kuŵalanga 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoshua 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, pachachajonanga ŵandu ŵa ilambo ichampe ŵanyamwe, katema pachimwaŵinje ni kutama mu misi jao ni mmajumba gao, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />pelepo chinsagule misi jitatu pasikati ja chilambo chaakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwenu kuti chiŵe chenu. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Chinkolosye matala gagakwaula ku misi jo ni kuchigaŵa mbaande sitatu chilambo chaakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu, kuti mundu jwalijose jwakuulaga njakwe akombole kuutuchila kweleko. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mundu ammulagaga njakwe pangaŵa kwamele, akuno nganaŵa jwammagongo jwakwe, akukombola kuutuchila musi umo mwa misi ji, ni kuukulupusya umi wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Tuŵanichisye kuti, ŵandu ŵaŵili ajawile kulitinji kutema sasu, ni paakata chitela liŵago likuliche mumpini mwakwe ni kummulaga njakwe. Jwakuulaga njakwe jo akukombola kuutuchila ku musi umo mwa misi ji ni kuukulupusya umi wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Nambo iŵaga musi wakuutuchila wo ukaliji umope ni sooni uli kwakutalichila kwannope, ni jwakuuchisya ligongo atumbile kwannope akukombola kunkuilisya ni kunkamula ni kummulaga jwele mundu jwammuleje njakwe jo, nachiŵamuno jwauleje jo nganalamulikwa chiwa, nombe ŵele ŵandu ŵaŵili wo yaani jwakuulaga ni jwawile nganaŵa ŵammagongo. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Lyelelyo ni ligongo nansalile mwanya nsapule misi jitatu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, patajijonjechesye mipika chilambo chenu, mpela iŵatite pakulanga kwa chilumbilo kwa achambuje ŵenu ni kumpa ŵanyamwe chele chilambo chiŵalanjile cho, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />iŵaga chingakamulilsye makanyo ga gingumpanga lelo jino, mwaanonyelaga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwenu ni kugakuya matala gao moŵa gose, nipele chinjonjechesye misi jiine jitatu. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Ntendeje yeleyo kuti moŵa gose mundu jwangali ni chileŵo akaika kuulajikwa mu chilambo chenu chakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu, ni kuntesya mme ŵaali ni chileŵo chakuulaga ŵandu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Nambo iŵaga mundu akunchima nlongo njakwe, ni anjuŵililaga njakwe jo ni kummulaga mwamele, nombejo autuchilaga musi umo mwa misi ji, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />Pelepo achachekulu ŵa musi wo chalajisye ŵandu ŵaatyosye kweleko ni kunjausya kwa jwakuuchisya maulago kuti aulajikwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Nkankolela chanasa mundu jwakuulaga njakwe. Kwayele chinnekasye ugongomalo wa kuulaga mundu jwangali chileŵo mu Isilaeli kuti nkombole kutama mu chitendewele.”<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipika jakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Mu chilambo chakumpanga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chiŵe chenu nkajityosya mipika ja jwapachiŵandi penu jeŵiche chile ni achachekulu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malamusi gankati ŵaumboni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Umboni wa mundu jumo ngaukukwanilisya kunlamula mundu nkati chileŵo chachilichose pane ugongomalo uliwose wautesile. Chindu chikusachilwa chisalikwe ni ŵaumboni ŵaŵili pane ŵatatu, pelepo ni pachichikundikwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Iŵaga mundu akunlambuchisya njakwe magambo ni akusimanikwa kuti akuŵecheta ya unami, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />mundu jwakuŵechetelwa magambo jo ni mundu jwakupeleka umboni wa unani, wosepe ajaule pauto pakupopelela paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti akalamulikwe ni ŵambopesi ni ŵakulamula ŵaali pamasengo pa lyele lyuŵa lyo. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Ŵakulamula akusachilwa auchilichisye chenene nkati magambo go. Jwaumboni awonekaga kuti ali jwaunami ni sooni iŵaga akummechetela njakwe kwa unami, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />mumpanganyichisye mwakulandana ni mwele mwakasachile jwalamulikwe apanganyichiswe. Pakutenda yeleyo ŵandu ngaatenda chakusakala chanti yeleyo pasikati penu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Ŵandu ŵane pachapikane chajogope, ni ugongomalo wanti nyi ngautyochela sooni pasikati jenu. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Nkalosya chanasa kwa ŵandu ŵanti nyi. Umi chiulipilwe ni umi, liso ni liso, ni lino ni lino ni nkono ni nkono ni lukongolo ni lukongolo.”<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Malamusi gankati ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Pachinjaule ku ngondo kukuputana ni ŵammagongo ŵenu, iŵaga nkulola falalsi ni mutuka syasikukwekwelemwa ni falasi ni ŵangondo ŵajinji kwapunda ŵenu, nkaika kogopa. Ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, juŵankopwesye ku Misili chaŵe pamo ni ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Nkanitande kuputana ngondo jwambopesi aiche paujo penu ni ŵaasalile ŵangondo kuti, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />‘Mwanya ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli mumbilikanile! Lelo nkwaula ku ngondo kukuputana ni ŵammagongo ŵenu. Nkapwa ntima namose nkajogopa, nkatetemela ni nkakamulwa ndengu. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu chajaule pamo ni ŵanyamwe ni kuputana ngondo ni ŵammagongo ŵenu kwaligongo lyenu ni chakampe kupunda.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Achakulungwa ŵa ŵangondo chiŵaasalile ŵangondo kuti, ‘Uli apali mundu jwataŵile nyuumba sambano ni nganajilimbule? Iŵaga apali apano auje kumangwakwe, ngakaŵa kuulajikwa ku ngondo, ni mundu jwine kujilimbula jele nyuumba jasambano jo. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Uli apali mundu jwakwete ngunda wa misabibu ni nganatande kaŵa isogosi yakwe? Iŵaga apali apano auje kumangwakwe, ngakaŵa kuulajikwa ku ngondo ni mundu jwine tasangalalile isogosi yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Uli apali mundu jwatomele jwankongwe ni ali chiŵandi kulombela? Iŵaga apali apano auje kumangwakwe, ngakaŵa kuulajikwa ku ngondo ni mundu jwine kulombela jwele jwankongwe jo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />“Sooni achakulungwa ŵa ngondo chajonjechesye kusala nyi, ‘Uli apali mundu jwakogopa pane kupwa ntima? Iŵaga apali apano auje kumangwakwe, ngakaŵa kwatesya woga achinjakwe.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Achakulungwa ŵa ngondo pachamalisye kukunguluka ni ŵandu, chasagule ilongola ŵa mpingo uli wose ŵa ŵangondo kuti ŵaalongosye.”<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Pachinjaule chiŵandi ni musi kukuputa ngondo, mwausye iŵaga akuchisaka chitendewele. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Akundaga ni kumbugulila milango jakwinjilila mmisi jao, ŵandu ŵaali mwelemo wose chachiŵa achikapolo ŵenu, ni chachimpanganyichisya masengo gakukanganichiswa. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Nambo iŵaga ŵandu ŵa musi wo akukana chitendewele, ni akusagula yakumenyana ngondo, nipele chimuusyungule wele musi wo ni kuuputa. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Iŵaga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akunkamuchisya kwapunda ŵandu ŵa musi wo, nkaaulaje achalume wose ŵaali mwelemo. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Nambo achakongwe ni ŵanache ni ilango ni kila chindu chachili mwelemo nkajigale kuti iŵe yenu. Nkaisagalalile indu yosepe ya ŵammagongo ŵenu yele yampele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Yeleyo ni ichinchitenda kwa misi jinajose jajili kwakutalichila ni chilambo chichinchitenda chenu.”<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />“Nambo pachinjigale misi ja chilambo chakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu, nkaulaje kila chindu. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Nkamale kwaulaga Ŵahiti, ni Ŵaamoli ni Ŵakanaani ni Ŵapelisi ni Ŵahivi ni Ŵayebusi mpela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu iŵatite pakunnajisya. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Mwaaulaje ŵanawose akaika kunjiganya indu yao yauchimwa yakuipanganya paakujipopelela minungu jao jachilendo ni kuntesya mme ŵandu ŵangakulupilichika kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Pachimmusyungule musi pa kujiputa ngondo, choonde nkaigwisya itela yakusogola isogosi. Ligongo itela yo nganiiŵa ŵammagongo ŵenu ni sooni ŵanyamwe komboleka kulya isogosi yakwe, kwapele nkaikata itela yo. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Nkukombola kukata itela yangaŵa ya isogosi ni kupanganyichisya makwelelo ga palikumba, ni indu ine yakutendela masengo pakuputa ngondo mu musi unkulimbana nao mpaka msumwile.”<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Yankati jwakuulaga jwangamanyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Mu chilambo chitakampe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kuti chikaŵe chenu, asimanikwaga mundu aulajikwe ali mwikonde ni ngakumanyika jwammuleje, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />achakulu ŵenu ni ŵakulamula ajaule ku malo ko ni akalole utaliche wakwe, malo gali mundu jwawile jo ni musi wakuŵandikana ni malo go. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Achakulu ŵa wele musi wauli chiŵandi nnope ni malo gagali mundu jwawile ajigale ng'ombe jamwana jankolo, janganijipanganye masengo gagaligose. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Ajaule najo ng'ombe jo kwichela kwakuli kasulo kangajumulila, kumalo kunganalimeje namose kupanda mbeju jilijose. Kweleko akajitemangule lukosi ng'ombe jo. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Nombe ŵambopesi, ŵele ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Lawi ajaule nawo ku malo go, ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ŵaasagwile ŵanyawo kuti atumichile ni kwapa upile ŵandu mu liina lyakwe, sooni ni ŵapegwile ukombole wa kulamula magambo gose ga ukangani ni kwagunguluchila ŵane. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Achakulu wose ŵa nsinda wauli chiŵandika kwannope ni malo gaali mundu jwawile jo, anaŵanje makono gao pachanya pa ng'ombe jamwana jankolo jajitemangule lukosi kwilambo ko, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />ni kusala kuti, ‘Ngaŵa uweji ŵatummuleje mundu ju, sooni nganitwamanyilila ŵammuleje. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu mwalechelesye ŵandu ŵenu Ŵaisilaeli umwawombwele kutyochela ku Misili. Ntulechelesye uweji, ni ngasintuŵalanjila chileŵo chakummulaga mundu jwangali chileŵo, nambo mwalechelesye chileŵo cho.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Kwayele, kwakutendekanya yele yakwisaka Ambuje Akunnungu, ngammalanjikwa chileŵo cha maulago ga.”<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkati achakongwe ŵakukamulwa ku ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Mwajaulaga kungondo kukuputana ni ŵammagongo ŵenu, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu antesyaga mpunde, ni kwakamula ŵandu ŵajinji, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />jumo jwenu ammonaga jwankongwe jwakusalala pasikati ja ŵandu ŵakamwilwe ku ngondo jwaŵannonyele ni nkusaka kulolemba, nipele alombeleje. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Ajaule najo jwankongwe jo kumangwakwe, kweleko akamyole umbo ni kukata ngose syakwe, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />ni akawule nguo syawasile paŵakamwilwe ku ngondo. Atame mu nyuumba mwekwe mo mwesi wantundu ali nkulila malilo ga achinangolo ŵakwe, ali amasile kulila malilo go, akukombola kunjigala ni kuŵa ŵankwakwe. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Nambo aonaga kuti ngaakunsaka sooni jwankongwe jo, anneche ajaule kulikose kuchasache kwaula. Ngaikomboleka mmwe kunsumisya namose kuntendela mpela kapolo, ligongo mwagonile nawo mpela ŵankwenu.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu yakusachilwa kupegwa mwanache jwannume jwakwitiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Jwannume akolaga achakongwe ŵaŵili, jwine akunnonyela nnope kumpunda jwine, ni wose ŵanaŵaŵili ŵaaŵelechele ŵanache ŵachilume, mwanache jwandanda kupangwa aŵaga jwa jwankongwe jwangakunnonyela nnope, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />mundu jo katema pakwagaŵila ŵanache ŵakwe chipanje chakwe, akasatenda lusagu pakumpa mwanache jwa jwankongwe jwakunnonyela mbua jajikusachilwa kumpa mwanache jwandanda kupagwa. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Akusachilwa ankunde ajula mwanache jwandanda kupagwa kwa jwankongwe jwangannonyela, kwa kungaŵila indu yakungaŵila kaŵili mu indu yakwete, nachiŵamuno ali mwanache jwakupagwa kwa jwankongwe jwangakunnonyela nnope.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malajisyo gankati ŵanache ŵangapikana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Mundu akolaga mwanache jwannume jwali jwamakani jwangapikana, sooni jwakalamuka, jwangaapikanila atatigwe ni achikulugwe atamuno anjamukaga, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />atatigwe ni achikulugwe mwanache jo ankamule ni kunjausya kwa achakulu ŵa musi wo kunnango wekulungwa wa wele musi wo. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Achinangolo asale kwa achakulu wo kuti, ‘Mwanache jwetu ju ali jwamakani ni ngakusaka kutupilikanila, ngakusaka kutupikana. Sooni akunyela kwannope sooni ali jwakolelwa.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Pelepo ŵandu ŵa musi wo champonye maganga mwanache jo mpaka kuwa. Pakutenda yeleyo chinchilekasya ugongomalo wo pasikati jenu. Ŵaisilaeli wose chapikane ni kogopa.”<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malamusi gane gane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Mundu akolaga ligambo lyalikusachilwa aulajikwe ni kuulajikwa, chiilu chakwe chikolekwe pa chitela, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />chiilu cho chikagona pachitela po. Achisiche lyuŵa lilyolyo pakuŵa chiilu cha mundu jwaakolekwe pa chitela chikuichisya malweso pa chilambo kutyochela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. Nkantesya Ambuje Akunnungu achikane chilambo champele kuti chiŵe chenu.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Iŵaga nkujiwona ng'ombe pane ngondolo ja nlongo njenu Mwisilaeli jili jipotele, nkajileka, nambo njisakule kujiusya kwa asyene. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Iŵaga nsyene jo ngakutama chiŵandi ni mmwe pane iŵaga ngankwamanyilila njisakule mpaka kumangwenu, njigose mpaka nsyene jo pachaiche kujisosa, nomwe mwapeje. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Ntendeje iyoyo peyo iŵaga nkujisimana mbunda ja mu Isilaeli njenu pane chakuwala chakwe pane chilichose chachipotele. Nkalitenda kuti nganinchiwona.”<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Iŵaga nkujisimana mbunda pane ng'ombe ja mu Isilaeli njenu jili jigwile mwitala nkalitenda kuti nganimwawona. Munkamuchisye njenu jo kuti achijimusye chinyama chakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Achakongwe akawala yakuwala ya achalume ni achalume akawala yakuwala ya achakongwe. Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akwachima ŵandu ŵakutenda yeleyo.”<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Iŵaga nkuchisimana chisusi cha chijuni, iweje mu chitela pane paasi, nangolo ali awutamule mandanda, pane ali ni makandi gakwe, nkajigala nangolo ni makandi gakwe. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Nkukombola kugajigala makandi gakwe, nambo nangolo munneche aguluche ni kwaula, kwakutenda yeleyo Ambuje Akunnungu chantende indu yenu injaulile yambone ni chintame moŵa gamajinji.”<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Pankutaŵa nyuumba nsyunguchisye nchejeka mumbali mwa nsakasa, akaika ŵandu kunlalatila iŵaga mundu agwile kutyochela kweleko ni kuwa.”<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Nkapanda mbeju sya mitundu jiwili mu ngunda wenu wa misabibu, mwatendaga yeleyo, kutandilila isogosi ya misabibu ni mbeju sine syo ngaikundikwa paujo pa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Nkataŵa ng'ombe ni mbunda kuti ilimeje pamo.”<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Nkawala nguo jakupanganyikwa mwakupwatikanya usi wa manyunya ga ngondolo ni nguo jeswele mbee.”<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Ntaŵe iundo mu mbande ncheche sya chakuwala chenu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luchimbichimbi nkati kuwonegana mundu ni ŵankwakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Mundu alombelaga mwali ni kugona nawo, panyuma pakwe ni akusala kuti ngakunsaka mwali jo, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />ni akutanda kunlambuchisya indu ya unami yakutesya soni, ni yakusakasya mbili jakwe, pakusala kuti, ‘Mwali ju nganawoneka kuti ŵaliji mwalimwalipe pa lyuŵa linanlombile.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />“Nipele achinangolo ŵa mwali jo ajigale chimanyisyo chachikulosya kuti mwali jo ŵaliji umwalimwalipe ni kuchijausya kwa achakulu pa nnango wekulungwa wa musi wo. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Atatigwe mwali jo chiŵaasalile achakulu ŵapankungulu wo kuti, ‘Nanlombekasisye mwali jwangu kwa jwanchanda ju nambo sambano ngakunsaka, <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Sano akunlambuchisya indu ya unami pakusala kuti nganawoneka kuti ŵaliji mwalimwalipe pa lyuŵa linanlombile. Nambo apano chipali chindu chakulosya kuti mwali jwangu ŵaliji mwalimwalipe’ Nipele achinangolo ŵakwe chasambalukule nguo ni kulosya umboni wo kwa achakulu ŵa musi. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Pelepo achakulu ŵa musi chankamule jwele jwannume jo ni kumputa mbokola. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Chanlipisye mundu jo ipande mia moja ya madini ga feza ni kwapa atatigwe mwali jo, pakuŵa jwannume jo antendekasisye mwali jwa Chiisilaeli aŵilanjikwe liina lyangalumbana. Nombe jwankongwe jo chaŵe ŵankwakwe, ni ngaakombola kwapa talaka mu umi wakwe wose.”<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />“Nambo iŵaga magambo go gali ga isyene, ni nganiupagwa umboni wakulosya kuti mwali jo ŵaliji umwalimwalipe, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />chanjigale mwali jo mpaka pannango wa nyuumba ja atatigwe, ni kweleko ŵandu ŵa mmusi mo amponye maganga mpaka kuwa. Atesile chindu chaasoni mu Isilaeli kwa kutenda chigwagwa ali mu nyuumba ja atatigwe. Kwa kutenda yeleyo chinchilekasya ugongomalo wo pasikati jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Mwansimanaga jwannume ali nkutenda chikululu ni jwankongwe jwa mundu jwine, wose ŵanaŵaŵili aulajikwe. Kwakutenda yeleyo chinchilekasya ugongomalo wo pasikati jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />“Jwannume ansimanaga ku boma mwalimwalipe jwatomelwe, ni kugona nawo, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />mwapeleche ŵanawose ŵaŵili paasa musi ni kwaponya maganga mpaka awe. Mwali jo akusachilwa aulajikwe ligongo ngananyanyisya kuti ŵaakamuchisye nachiŵamuno ŵaliji mboma, ni jwannume jo nombe aulajikwe ligongo ansakesye jwankongwe jwatomelwe ni njakwe. Kwakutenda yeleyo chinchilekasya ugongomalo wo pasikati jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Nambo jwannume ansimanaga mwali jwatomelwe kumigunda ni kunkamulila, jwannume jwatesile yeleyo jo jika ni juchaulajikwe. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Mwali jo nkampanganyichisya chachili chose, jwelejo nganaleŵa mwakuichila kulamulikwa kuulajikwa. Chele chindu chi chili yalumo ni cha mundu jwakungunguluchila njakwe ni kummulaga mwamele, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />pakuŵa jwannume jo ŵansimene mwali jo kumigunda, nachiŵamuno mwali jo ŵagumisile, nganapagwa mundu jwakunkamuchisya.”<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />“Jwannume asimanaga mwali jwangatomelwa, ankamulilaga ni ŵandu kwasimanila, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />jwannume jo anlipe atatigwe mwali jo ipande hansini ya feza ligongo ansakesye, ni mwali jo aŵeje ŵankwakwe, ni ngaakombola kwaleka mu umi wakwe wose.”<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“Jwannume akagona ni jwankongwe jwa atatigwe. Chelechi chichinjalusye atatigwe.”<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Kutyosekwa pa mpingo wa ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Jwannume jwalijose jwankasile mbujuju, pane jwankatile kuyalo kwakwe akajinjila pa nsongangano wa ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />“Mundu jwalijose jwapagwile mmaukutu namose iŵelesi yakwe mpaka mpago wa likumi, akajinjila pa nsongangano wa ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />“Mundu jwalijose jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵaamoni pane Ŵamoabu ni iŵelesi yao yose mpaka mpago wa likumi akakundikwa kwinjila mu nsongangano wa ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Ligongo ŵele ŵandu wo ŵanjiimile yakulya ni meesi pamwaliji mwitala kutyoka ku Misili, sooni pakuŵa ŵampele mbiya che Balaamu mwanagwe che Beoli jwa ku Petoli jajili ku Mesopotamia kuti annwesye ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Namose yeleyo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nganampilikanila che Balaamu nambo ŵagagalawisye malweso gakwe kuŵa upile kwa ŵanyamwe, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵannonyelanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Kwayele nkatenda chindu chachilichose chakwakamuchisya ŵandu ŵa ngosyo si kwakuti ŵandu ŵa, apate chitendewele namose kutama utame wa kusichila.”<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Nkaachima Ŵaedomu pakuŵa ŵele ŵanyawo ali achalongo achinjenu. Sooni nkaachima Ŵamisili pakuŵa mwatemi ku chilambo chao mpela achalendo. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Uŵelesi wa ngosyo si kutandilila mpago waatatu akukomboleka kwinjila mu nsongangano wa Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupasalalisya pachigono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Pankwaula kuputana ngondo ni ŵammagongo ŵenu, mwaŵikaga chigono, nlilolechesye, nkatenda chindu chachilichose chachichintesye ŵanyamwe nkakundikwa ni Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Iŵaga jwannume jwalijose pasikati penu ngakukundikwa ni Akunnungu ligongo lyakuti asagamile chilo ni waakopweche usyungo, akopoche ni kwaula kutama paasa pa chigono. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Nambo jaikaga ligulo ajoje, ni lyuŵa lyatiŵilaga aujile ku chigono.”<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Nkakolosye malo paasa pa chigono kuchinjaule kukusyetelela. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Mu yakumenyanilana yenu nkoleje chakusolela chakuti pachinjaule kukusyetelela nsoleje lisimbo, nli mmasile nsilile manyi mwisimbo mo. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Chigono chenu chiŵeje chesalele chenene, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akwendajenda pachigono penu kuti anlindilile ni kunkamuchisya kuti mwapunde ŵammagongo ŵenu pangondo. Kwayele chigono chenu chiŵe malo gakusalala kuti Ambuje Akunnungu akaona chindu chilichose pasikati jenu chachili chakusakala, akagalauka ni kunneka jikape.”<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malamusi gakulekanganalekangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Iŵaga kapolo autuchile kukwenu nkammusya kwa ambujegwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Munneche atame pasikati jenu palipose pachasache ni pa musi wauliwose uchasagule. Nkammonela.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli pakasimanikwa mundu jwalijose aŵeje jwankongwe pane jwannume jwali jwakulaŵalaŵa ku nyuumba jaakujipopelela minungu jao. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Mbiya jajilijose jajipatikene kwa kulaŵalaŵa ko nkajijausya ku nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwaligongo lya kutindimisya nasili jilijose pakuŵa jwannume pane jwankongwe jwakutenda yeleyo akuchimikwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Mwankongosyaga nlongo njenu Mwisilaeli nkansalila ammuchisye ni mapwati gakwe, iŵeje mbiya pane chakulya pane chindu chine chilichose chati ŵandu akukongosya ni kusaka mapwati gakwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Jwannendo nkukombola kunkongosya ni kunsalila ammuchisye ni mapwati gakwe, nambo ngaŵa nlongo njenu Mwisilaeli, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, champe upile mu indu yose itinkaitende mu chilambo chinkwaula kuchitenda kuŵa chenu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />“Iŵaga nkuŵika nasili kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nkakaaŵa kuchitenda chimmisile nasili cho, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu chachindai, nomwe chinkole ni sambi. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Iŵaga ngankuŵika nasili kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ngaŵa sambi. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Nlilolechesye kujitendekanya nasili jinsasile pakang'wa penu, pakuŵa nlanjile mwasyene kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Mwajinjilaga mu ngunda wa misabibu wa nlongo njenu Mwisilaeli, nkukomboleka kulya isogosi ya sabibu nli mu ngunda pemo inkuti kusaka, nambo nkakaŵa ni kujigala isogosi yo mu chitundu chenu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />“Mwapitaga mungunda wa nlongo njenu Mwisilaeli wauli ni magungulo nkukombola kukwanyula ni makono genu ni kulya, nambo nkajigala chikwakwa kukata.”<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Malamusi gankati kulekangana ni kuujilana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Mundu alombelaga jwankongwe ni kunleka pakuŵa achiweni chindu changakuchisaka kwa jwankongwe jo, anlembelega talaka ni kwapa ni kwaŵinga atyoche mu nyuumba jakwe, <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />pakumala kutyoka alombwaga ni jwannume jwine, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />nombe jwannume jwaaŵili jo anchimaga jwankongwe jo ni kunlembela talaka ni kwapa ni kwaŵinga atyoche mu nyuumba jakwe, pane jwannume jo ajasikaga, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />pelepo ajula jwannume jwaandanda jula ngakusachilwa kulombela jwankongwe jo kaaŵili ligongo ngakukundikwa paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Kutenda yeleyo nkwachima Ambuje Akunnungu. Nkaikanasyo sambi pa chilambo chakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malamusi gane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Mundu alombelaga mwasambano akajaula ku ngondo atamuno ngasimwapa masengo gane galigose. Mwaleche atame pamusi kwa chaka chimo ni kwanonyelesya ŵankwankwe.”<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Mundu jwalijose akajigala lisyago pane ngasi kuŵa chikole, kutenda yeleyo chimme njigele indu yakukolochesya chakulya kuti alame.”<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Mundu akamulwaga ali nkunjigala Mwisilaeli njakwe ni kuntenda nti kapolo, pane kunsumisya ku ukapolo mundu jo aulajikwe. Kwakutenda yeleyo chinchilekasya ugongomalo wo pasikati jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Mundu alwalaga matana, mpanganye mpela igakuti kusala malajisyo ga ŵambopesi ŵaali Ŵalawi. Ngakuye kwakulilolechesya malajisyo ginaapele ŵanyawo. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Nkumbuchilanje achila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu chiŵampanganyichisye che Miliamu pimwaliji mwitala kutyochela ku Misili.”<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Pankunkongosya njenu chilichose, nkajinjila mu nyuumba jakwe kuti nkajigale chikole. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Nlindilileje paasa, mundu jumunkongwesye jo aiche nacho kukumpa nsyene chikole cho. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Iŵaga mundu jo ali jwakulaga, nkatama najo nguo jakuliunichila chilo nti chikole. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Nchiusye kwa asyene lyuŵa likanaŵe kutula kuti aliunichile ni kunsachila upile. Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tachiŵa ŵakusengwa ni mmwejo.”<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Nkannyenga jwamasengo jwenu jwakulaga ni jwakusaka ukamuchisyo, aŵeje Mwisilaeli njenu pane jwannendo jwakutama mmusi umo mwa misi jenu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Munlipe malipilo gakwe lyuŵa lilyolyo lyuŵa likanaŵe kutula, ligongo jwelejo ali jwakulaga ni malipilo gagogo akugakulupilila muntima mwakwe. Iŵaga ngankunlipa tachinlilila Ambuje Akunnungu, nomwe tinchikola chileŵo cha sambi.”<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Achinangolo akaulajikwa kwaligongo lya ileŵo ya ŵanache ŵao, iyoyo peyo ŵanache akaulajikwa kwaligongo lya ileŵo ya achinangolo ŵao. Mundu jwalijose aulajikwe kwaligongo lya ileŵo yakwe nsyene.”<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Nkatendekasya achalendo pane ŵamalekwa, kulepela kupata yakusachilwa kupata atamuno nkajigala chakuwala cha jwankongwe jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe kuŵa chikole. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Nkumbuchileje yakuti mwanya mwaliji achikapolo ku chilambo cha Misili, sooni kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ŵammombwele ntyoche kweleko. Lyelelyo ni ligongo nampele mwanya lilajisyo li.”<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Pankugungula magungulo mmigunda mwenu, mwaliŵalilaga magungulo gane, nkauja kukujigala. Mwalechelanje achalendo, ni ŵamalekwa ni achakongwe ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, Aunnungu ŵenu ampe upile mmasengo genu gose. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Pankukaŵa isogosi ya seituni mu migunda jenu, nkaujila sooni kaaŵili kukaŵa. Nneche syasisigele syo kwaligongo lya achalendo ni ŵamalekwa ni achakongwe ŵawilile ni achiŵankwawo. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Pankukaŵa sabibu mu ngunda mwenu nkauja sooni kaaŵili kukukaŵa. Nneche syasisigele syo kwaligongo lya achalendo ni ŵamalekwa ni achakongwe ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Nkumbuchile yakuti mwanya mwaliji achikapolo ku chilambo cha ku Misili. Lyelelyo ni ligongo nampele mwanya lilajisyo li.”<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Kwaŵaga ni umenyani pasikati ja ŵandu ŵaŵili, ajaulaga ku nkungulu, jumo asimanikwaga jwangali chileŵo ni jwine kulamulikwa kuti akwete chileŵo, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />iŵaga mundu jwakwete chileŵo jo alamulikwe kuputikwa mbokola, jwakulamula jo chanlamulile jwakuleŵa jo kuti agone pasi ni kuputikwa mbokola malinga ni chileŵo chakwe. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Akukomboleka kuputikwa mbokola alobaini, nambo ikapunda pelepo. Iŵaga ikupunda pelepo, timuntende akole soni mpwenu jo.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Nkajitaŵa kukang'wa ng'ombe jajikupanganya masengo gakuputukula magungulo.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu yakusachilwa kupanganya mundu kwa mpwakwe jwawile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Iŵaga mundu ni mpwakwe akutama pamalo gamo ni jumo akuwa, nambo nganaleka mwanache jwannume, jwankongwe jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe jo akalombekwa ni mundu jwa paasa nnango wo. Mpwakwe maleemu jo tajinjile majumba kwa jwele jwankongwe jo. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mwanache jwannume jwandanda kupagwa mwele mu nyuumba mo tachiŵalanjikwa kuti ali mwanache jwa maleemu kuti liina lyakwe likawa mu chilambo cha Isilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Nambo iŵaga nlongo jwa maleemu jo ngakusaka kulombela jwankongwe jo, nipele jwankongwe jo ŵaajaulile achakulungwa ŵa musi wo pannango wekulungwa wakwinjilila mmusi ni kwasalila, ‘Nlongo njakwe maleemu ŵankwangu ngakusaka kulombela une kuti meleche, liina lya maleemu jo likawa mu chilambo cha Isilaeli.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Pelepo achakulu wa musi wo chammilanje ni kukunguluka nao. Iŵaga chajendelechele kukana kuti ngakulombela, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />jwele jwankongwe jwa maleemu jo ajaule kwa nlambagwe, achakulu wa musi wo ali nkunlolechesya, ammule chilatu cha lukongolo lumo ni kunsunila mata kumesoni kunsalila, ‘Yelei ni ikuti kuŵajilwa kumpanganyichisya mundu jwakukana kuutenda uŵelesi wa nkulugwe ujendelechele.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Ŵandu ŵa munyuumba ja mundu jo chamanyiche mu Isilaeli mpela ‘Nyuumba ja mundu jwaulikwe chilatu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malamusi gane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Iŵaga achalume ŵaŵili akumenyana, ni jwankongwe jwa jwannume jumo, pakusaka kwakamuchisya ŵankwakwe akunkamula mundu jwakumenyana ni ŵankwakwe wo ku yalo, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />nkankolela chanasa jwele jwankongwe jo, munkate nkono wakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Nkaajiŵila ŵandu pakola maganga gaŵili gakupimila, limo lyakutopa ni liine lyangatopa. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Nkakola ni yakupimila iŵili yakupisyangana mu nyuumba jenu, chimo chekulungwa ni chiine chenandi. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Liganga lyakupimila, ni ipimo iŵeje mpela yaikuti kusachilwa kuti nkatame moŵa gamajinji mu chilambo chakumpa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwenu, kuti chiŵe chenu. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, akwachima ŵandu ŵakuitendekanya indu mpela ayiyi ya kwalambusya ŵandu.”<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilajisyo lyakwaulaga Ŵaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Nkaliŵalila achila chiŵantesile Ŵaamaleki pamwaliji mwitala kutyoka ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Nkumbuchile pamwaliji mpesile kwannope ŵankuiye munyuma ni kwaulaga wose ŵaŵaikaga panyuma ligongo lyakupela. Ŵaamaleki nganiŵaajogopa Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Kwayele, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu patachimpumusya ni ngondo ja ŵammagongo wenu ŵakutama mwakusyungulila chilambo chitakampe mwanya kuti chiŵe chenu, nkusachilwa mwaulaje Ŵaamaleki wose, nkaliŵalila.<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Magungulo gagakwausya kwa Ambuje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />“Patinkajinjile mu achila chilambo chichakampe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti chiŵe chenu, ni kutama mwelemo, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />nkajigale milimbu kutyochela mu chilambo chitakampe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nkasiŵiche mu chitundu. Nkajausye pa malo gamo giŵagasagwile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kuti ŵaapopelele pelepo. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Munjaulileje jwambopesi jwaali pa masengo lyele lyuŵa lyo ni kunsalila, ‘Lelo ngusala nansyene paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwangu, kuti nyinjile mu chilambo chiŵaalanjile achambuje ŵetu kuti tachitupa uweji.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />“Jwambopesi chapochele chitundu cho mmakono mwenu ni tachitamiche paasi paujo pa chilisa cha Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Nomwe chinkasale aga maloŵe ga paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ‘Atati ŵangu ŵaliji Mwalamu juŵajendajendaga akuno ni akunokuno, nipele ŵatulwiche kwaula ku Misili ni kutama kweleko nti jwannendo. Pakwaula kweleko ŵelewo ni achalongo ŵakwe ŵaliji ŵandu kanandipe, nambo kanyuma ŵatupile ni ŵaliji ŵandu ŵa machili ni chilambo chachili ni machili. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Nambo Ŵamisili ŵatupanganyichisye yangalumbana, ni ŵatulagasisye ni kutukanganyichisya kupanganya masengo gakulimba mpela achikapolo. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Nipele, uweji twalisile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa achambuje ŵetu, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵakupilikene kulila kwetu, sooni ŵakuweni kulaga kwetu, ni kugawona masengo gamakulungwa gaŵatukanganichisyaga gala ni masauko getu. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵatukulupwisye kwele ku Misili ko kwa machili ni ukombole. Ŵatesile yakusimonjeka ni imanyisyo yejinji ikopochele. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Nombewo atujigele mpaka akuno ni kutupa chilambo chi, chilambo chachili ni chajila chachikufai kulanga ilango yejinji ni kulima. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Sambano une nyiiche kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, ni liunjili lya milimbu jangu ja mu chilambo chambele une.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Nipele nchitamiche chitundu cho paasi paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ni kukotama mpaka paasi paujo pakwe. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Nomwe nkajangalile indu yambone yampele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, mmwe ni ŵamunyuumba jenu. Nkasangalale pamo ni Ŵalawi ni achalendo ŵakutama pasikati jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />“Chaaka chaatatu chilichose mpelecheje liunjili lyakakumi lya magungulo genu kwa Ŵalawi ni kwa achalendo ni ŵamalekwa ni achakongwe ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo kuti ku misi jakutama ŵele ŵandu ŵa akoleje yakulya yakwanila. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Nipele chinsale yelei paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ‘Ndyosisye mu nyuumba mwangu liunjili lyakakumi, mbeleche kwa Ŵalawi ni kwa achalendo ni kwa ŵamalekwa ni kwa achakongwe ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo mpela imwatite pakuulamulila mbanganye. Nganinagatema makanyo genu namose kugaliŵalila namose limo. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Une nganindye liunjili lyakakumi lyalililyose panaliji nkulila malilo, ni sooni nganindyosya liunjili lyakakumi mu nyuumba jangu panaliji ngangukundikwa paujo penu natamuno nganimbeleka liunjili lyakakumi lyo kwa ŵandu ŵawile. Uneji nampikanile mmwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵangu, ndesile kila chindu chinlamwile tutende. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Nnole paasi kutyochela kwinani malo genu gamaswela, mwape upile Ŵaisilaeli ŵaali ŵandu ŵenu ni chilambo chachajila chatupele chi, mpela imwatite pakwalanjila achinangolo ŵetu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵakwe Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Lelo jino, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu akunlamulila kuti ngakamulichisye makanyo gawo gose ni malajisyo ga. Nlilolechesye kugapanganya kwa ntima wose ni kwa mbumu jose. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Lelo jino nsasile ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, ali Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kuti tingakuye matala gao gose ni kugakamulisya makanyo ni malajisyo gao ni mashalaiti gao ni kulijitichisya liloŵe lyao. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Nombe Ambuje Akunnungu, lelo jino ankundile mwanya kuti nli ŵandu ŵakwe nsyene mpela iŵatite pakunlanjila, ni kuti nkusachilwa kugakamulisya makanyo gao gose. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Tachintenda mwanya kuŵa ŵandu ŵa chilambo chekulungwa kupunda ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine ŵaŵaapanganyisye, ni ŵanyamwe tinlitesye liina lyakwe lilumbililwe ni kupegwa luchimbichimbi. Ŵanyamwe timme ŵandu ŵakwe mpela iŵatite pakulanga.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Malajisyo ga Akunnungu gagalembekwe pa maganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Nipele che Musa pamo ni achakulu ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵaalamulile ŵandu kuti, “Ngakamulisye malajisyo gose gingumpanga lelojino. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Palyuŵa litinjomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kwinjila mu chilambo chakumpanga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chinjimiche maganga gamakulungwa ni nkagasyasyajile. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Pachanya pakwe nkalembe malajisyo gose ga, pachinkajinjile mu chilambo chachili ni chajila chachikufai kwa kulima ni kulanga ilango yejinji mpela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa achambuje ŵenu iŵanlanjile. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Patinkamale komboka lusulo lwa Yolodani nkagajimiche maganga ga pa chitumbi cha Ebali mpela inguti kunlajisya lelojino, ni nkagasyasyajile. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Kweleko nkaataŵile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, chilisa chakutyochesya mbopesi, nambo nkakolosye ni maganga gangasepekwa. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Elo, chilisa chilichose chinkwataŵila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu chikusachilwa kutaŵikwa ni maganga gangasepekwa. Nkapelecheje mbopesi syakutinisya kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu pa chilisa po. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Mpelecheje mbopesi sya chitendeŵele ni kulila papopo ni kusengwa paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Nkagalembe maloŵe gosepe ga malajisyo ga mwakuwoneka chenene pa maganga po.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Nipele che Musa ni ŵambopesi ŵaali Ŵalawi ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli wose, “Ntame jii Ŵaisilaeli wose, mpikanile, lelojino mmele ŵandu ŵakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Kwayeleyo mpilikanichisye chaakusala Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu nchikuyaga makanyo gakwe ni malajisyo gakwe gingumpanga lelojino.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malweso kwa ŵandu ŵangakupilanichisya malajisyo ga Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Palyuŵa lilalila che Musa ŵaalajisye ŵandu achitiji, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Pachinjomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani, ngosyo si tisijime pa litumbi lya Gelisimu kupikanila katema Ambuje Akunnungu patachapa upile ŵandu: Lukosyo lwa Simeoni ni Lawi ni Yuda ni Isakali ni Yusufu ni Benjamini. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Ngosyo sya Lubeni ni Gadi ni Asheli ni Sabuloni ni Dani ni Nafutali tisijime pa chitumbi cha Ebali kupikanila katema Ambuje Akunnungu pakwalwesya ŵandu. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Nombe Ŵalawi chiŵasalile ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli kwaliloŵe lyakunyanyisya.”<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakupanganya chinyago chakusepa pane chakusyana ni kuchipopelela mwakusisika, chindu chekolosye ni makono ga ŵakolosya ni sooni chachili uchimwa kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga kuti, ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwanganchimbichisya atatigwe pane achikulugwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga kuti, ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakusejechesya mipika ja jwaŵandikene nawo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga kuti, ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakunsoyasya litala mundu jwangalola.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakummonela jwannendo ni ŵamalekwa ni achakongwe ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo, kuti akapata yakusachilwa kupata.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">“Ni ŵandu wose tajitichisye kuti, ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“ ‘Alweseche jwannume jwalijose jwakugona ni ŵakongwe ŵa atatigwe pakuŵa ŵatesisye soni atatigwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakugona ni chinyama chachilichose.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga ‘Eloo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakugona ni alumbugwe, aŵeje alumbugwe jwakulekangana achikulu pane alumbugwe jwakulekangana atati.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga ‘Eloo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakugona ni akwegwawo ŵakongwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakummulaga njakwe kwa chisyepela.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakupochela hongo kuti ammulaje njakwe jwangali ni chileŵo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijanga ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“ ‘Alweseche mundu jwalijose jwakukana kugajitichisya ni kugapilikanila aga maloŵe ga malajisyo ga.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">“Ni ŵandu wose tachijijanga ‘Eloo!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Upile waukupatikana kwa kupilikanichisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Ŵalawi 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />“Iŵaga nkugapilikanichisya maloŵe gosepe ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ni kugasunga mwakulupichika malajisyo gose gingumpa lelojino, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tachintenda mme chilambo chachikulungwa kupunda ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose ya pachilambo. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Mwampilikanichisyaga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu upile wose wu tiuchiŵa wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“Ambuje tachimpa upile mu yose ichinchipanganya mwaŵaga mu misi jenu ni tachimpa upile mwaŵaga mmigunda jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachimpa upile wakola ŵanache achajinji, ni magungulo gamajinji ni kola ng'ombe ni ngondolo syejinji.”<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachimpa upile kwa kumpa magungulo gamajinji ni mu yakulya itinkolosye kutyochela ni magungulo go.”<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachimpa upile mu kila chindu chinkuchipanganya.”<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachinkamuchisya kuti mwapunde pa ngondo ŵammagongo ŵenu paakungunguluchila. Aikaga kukungunguluchila kwa litala limo tachimmutuka kwa matala saba.”<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachipeleka upile pa ikuti yenu ya yakulya ni pa kila chindu chinkuchipanganya. Ambuje Akunnungu takampe upile ŵanyamwe mu chilambo chakumpanga cho.”<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“Iŵaga chinkaapikanile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kuipanganya indu yose yakunlamulila, takantende ŵanyamwe kuŵa ŵandu ŵakwe nsyene mpela muŵalanjile. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Sooni ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo tachilola kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, ansagwile ŵanyamwe kuŵa ŵandu ŵakwe, ni tachiŵa ali nkunjogopa. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachimpa upile wejinji, tachimpa ŵanache ŵajinji, ni ilango ni yakulya yejinji mu chilambo chiŵatesile chilanga ni achambuje ŵenu kuti tachimpa ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachintumichisya ula kutyochela kumalo kwakujigosa kwinani pa katema kakwe, sooni tachimpa upile pa masengo genu gose gatinkagapanganye. Tinchakongosya ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine nambo ŵanyamwe ngankongola kukwawo. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachintenda mme ŵakwalongosya ŵandu ŵa ilambo ni ngaŵa kunlongosya. Iŵaga nkugapilikanichisya mwakulupichika malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, gingumpanga lelojino, moŵa gose chimme ŵandu ŵa paujo, ni ngamma kunyuma. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Nambo nkaleka ng'o kugapilikanichisya malajisyo ni makanyo ga pane nkajipopelela ni kujitumichila minungu jine.”<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichiinsimane iŵaga ngampilikanichisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Ŵalawi 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Nambo iŵaga ngankumpilikanichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kuleka kugakamulisya malajisyo gakwe gose ni makanyo gakwe gingunlajisya lelo jino, malweso gose ga tigannyichilile.”<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachinlwesya mu indu inkuipanganya mmisi jenu ni mmigunda jenu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachisilwesya mbeju syenu ni sooni tachichilwesya chakulya chachikutyochela ni mbeju syo.”<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachinlwesya pakumpa ŵanache ŵangatupa, ni magungulo gangatupa ni ng'ombe ni ngondolo syenu ngasitupa.”<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachigalwesya masengo genu gose gatinchigapanganya.”<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />“Iŵaga nkutenda indu yakusakala ni kwakana Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, tachinnyichisya malweso, ni limbulunga ni utindiganyo ni masausyo mu kila chindu chinkuchipanganya mpaka mmale kuwa wose mwakwanguya. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachinnyichisya ilwele yakupisyangana mpaka wosepe tinkamale kuwa pa chilambo chinkwaula kuchitenda chenu cho. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachinnyichisya ilwele yakwambuchisyana ni yakwimbila ni kolela mooto pachilu ni ula ngajinya ni ntukuta ni ukulyungu. Yele indu yo tiinkuye mpaka patimmale kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Kwinani kutijumule mpela shaba jepiliu, pangali ula ni litaka tilijumule mpela chisyano. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Ambuje Akunnungu talitende luundu ni nsanga kuŵa ula jenu, luundu tilunnyelele mpaka wosepe patimmale kuwa.”<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachatenda ŵammagongo ŵenu ampunde ŵanyamwe pangondo. Chinchaula kukuputana ngondo kwa litala limo, nambo timwautuche ŵammagongo ŵenu wo kwa matala saba, nomwe tinchiŵa chindu cha uchimwa kwa ŵandu wose pachilambo. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Mitembo jenu tijiŵe chakulya cha ijuni ni inyama yamwitinji, ni ngapagwa mundu jwalijose jutaiŵinje. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachimputa ni yakuimbila mpela iŵaaputile ŵandu ŵa ku Misili. Iilu yenu tiichikola ilonda ni upele ni kunyanya pachilu, yosepe yi ngankombola kulama. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachimputanga ni masoka, ni ungalola ni kumpungwanisya muntwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Tinjende nli nkupapasyapapasya lyuŵa lili nkuŵala mpela mundu jwangalola. Masengo galigose gatinchipanganya ngagampa mboka. Ŵandu tachimmonelanga ni kunsumula indu yenu kaŵilikaŵili, ngaapagwa mundu jwalijose jutachinkamuchisya.”<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />“Tinchitomela jwankongwe, nambo tachilombekwa ni mundu jwine. Tinchitaŵa nyuumba nambo ngangona. Tinchipanda misabibu mu ngunda nambo nganlya isogosi yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ng'ombe syenu tisisinjikwe nli nkulola nambo nganlya nyama jakwe. Tinchisumulwa mbunda syenu kwa machili ni ngaammusya. Ngondolo syenu tisipelekwe kwa ŵammagongo ŵenu ni ngapagwa mundu jwalijose jutankamuchisye. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Ŵanache ŵenu ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe tajigalikwe ku ukapolo ni ŵandu ŵachilendo ŵanyamwe nli nkulola, tinnolele lyuŵa ni lyuŵa kuti panepa chauje mpaka chinnepele kuunukula meeso, nambo ngamwawona sooni. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Isogosi ya mchilambo chenu ni magowolo, yose inlasileje kulima chalye ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine ŵangankwamanyilila, ni ŵanyamwe tachimmonela ni kunlagasya pa moŵa genu gose. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Pachiinsimane indu yo tichintesya mme ŵamasoka. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachimputa mmalungo genu ni makongolo genu pakumpa yakuimba yakupweteka kwannope ni yangalamika, sooni tichikopoka pachiilu chose, kutandilila kusajo mpaka peuwo.”<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachinjausya ŵanyamwe ni mwenye jwenu juchimunsagule ku chilambo changanintameje ŵanyamwe pamo ni achinangolo ŵenu kalakala. Kweleko tinkajitumichile minungu jine jakupanganyikwa ni itela ni maganga. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Ŵandu ŵa yele ilambo itakanjausye Ambuje Akunnungu takatojime pakuiwona isausyo yenu yekulngwa yi, ni takanseche ni kuntendela chipongwe.”<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />“Tinchipanda mbeju syejinji mmigunda mwenu nambo tinchigungula indu kanandi pe, ligongo sombe tisilye mimela jenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Timpande misabibu ni kujilimila ni kujilolalola nambo isogosi yakwe ngankaŵa, namose kung'wa divai jakwe ligongo maungu tigamale kulya misabibu jo. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Tinchikola itela ya miseituni palipose mu chilambo chenu, nambo ngampata mauta gakwe ligongo isogosi yakwe tiichilakatichila paasi nganiikomale. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Tinchiŵeleka ŵananche ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe, nambo ngaaŵa ŵenu ligongo takajigalikwe mateeka. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Itela yenu yose ya isogosi ni magungulo ga mmigunda mwenu tiiligwe ni sombe.”<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />“Achalendo ŵakutama pachilambo penu tachiŵa ŵandu ŵakusichila ni ŵamachili, nambo ŵanyamwe tinchiŵa ŵandu ŵakulaga ni ŵakulopotoka. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Ŵanyawo tachikola mbiya syakunkongosya ŵanyamwe, nambo ŵanyamwe ngankola mbiya syakwakongosya ŵanyawo. Mbesi jakwe ŵanyawo tachintawala.”<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />“Malweso gose ga tigannyichilile ŵanyamwe, tigankuye ni kumpata mpaka patinjonasiche, ligongo nganimwapilikanichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ni kugakamulisya makanyo gakwe ni malajisyo gakwe giŵampele. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Isausyo yose yo tiichiŵa umboni wankati ulamusi wa Ambuje Akunnungu kukwenu ni kwa iŵelesi yenu moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵampele upile pa indu yosepe, nambo ŵanyamwe nganimwatumichila kwa kusengwa ni kwa mitima jenu jose. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Kwayele tinkaatumichile ŵammagongo ŵenu ŵatakantumichisye Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanyamwe. Tijinkole sala ni njota ni usauchi ni kusoŵekwa ni indu yose. Tachintendekasya masengo gakulimba mpaka patimmale kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Ambuje Akunnungu tannyichisye ŵandu kutyochela ku chilambo chakutalika kuti angungumuchile mpela kapungu yakuti kutuluchila yakulupata, ŵandu ŵangankuchimanyilila chiŵecheto chao, <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />ŵele ŵandu ŵa chilambo cho tachiloleka ŵakogoya, ŵangaikosya nkati achachekulu atamuno kwakolela chanasa achachanda. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Ŵanyawo tachilya ilango yenu ni magungulo genu, mpaka sala jimmulaje. Ŵanyawo ngasanlechelela yakulya, ni divai namose mauta pane ng'ombe pane ngondolo mpaka patimmale kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Ŵandu wo tachinsyungula mmisi jose ja mu chilambo chenu, palipose mu chilambo chitakampe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni makumba gantaŵile gamaleu gele gankugakulupilila go tagagwisye paasi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />“Katema patachinsyungula mmisi jenu ni kulagaswa ni ŵammagongo ŵenu, tiikansoŵe yakulya mpaka tinchalya ŵanache ŵenu ŵele ŵampele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Namose mundu jwambone ntima nnope ni jwalelitwe yambone tachinjima yakulya nlongo njakwe, ŵankwakwe ŵakunnonyela ni achiŵanagwe ŵasigalile, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />ngisangaŵila mundu jwalijose nyama ja ŵanache ŵakwe ŵatiŵalye. Ngansigalilwa ni chachilichose pa kele katema kakunsyungula ni kulagaswa ni ŵammagongo ŵenu mmisi jenu jose. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Atamuno jwankongwe jwakusichila jwalelitwe mwa mboka, jwanganaliŵete paasi kwakulikose, nombe najo tachitenda iyoyopeyo, tachajima namose ŵankwakwe ŵakunnonyela ni nchanda jwakwe ni mwali jwakwe, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />pa kele katema kakunsyungula ko tachilya nyama ja mwanache jwakwe jwa napagwa pe pamo ni likondo lya panyuma, pangamanyilila ŵankwakwe atamuno jumo mwa achiŵanagwe.”<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Iŵaga nganlilolechesya pakugapanganya maloŵe gose ga malajisyo gagalembekwe mu chitabu chi, ni sooni iŵaga nganlichimbichisya ni kulikusya liina lyekulu lyakogoya lya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />Ambuje Akunnungu tannyichisye ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene ni iŵelesi yenu, iputiko yakogoya ni imbulunga yekulungwa ni yangamala, ni ilwele yakogoya yangapikana ntela. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Tannyichisye sooni ilwele yakogoya imwaijogopaga ku Misili, nombeyo ngaimala kukwenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Sooni Ambuje Akunnungu tannyichisye ilwele yakulekanganalekangana ni malagasyo gane ganganagalembe mu chitabu chi cha malajisyo mpaka pachimmale kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Nachiŵamuno nli ŵandu ŵantupile mpela ndondwa sya kwinani, tinsigalile kanandi pe pakuŵa nganimwapilikanichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Mpela muyannonyele Ambuje Akunnungu kumpa upile ni kunchuluya kuti mme ŵandu ŵajinji, iyoyo peyo tiyanonyele kunnyichisya imbulunga ni kunjonanga ni kuntyosya mu chilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala ni kuchitenda chenu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />“Ambuje Akunnungu tachimpwilinganya pasikati jwa ilambo yose kutandilila upande umo wa chilambo mpaka upande wine, ni kweleko tinjitumichile minungu jakupanganyikwa ni itela ni maganga, jele janganamanyilila achachekulu ŵenu, namose ŵanyamwe chitandilile. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Ngankola chitendewele palipose patinjaule, namose ngankola malo gatinjile kuti gali genu mwachinsyene. Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu tachintesya mme ŵandu ŵaali ni lipamba ni meeso gagakupela kulola ni kupwa ntima. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Moŵa gose tinjogope kuti ŵammagongo ŵenu tachimmulaga. Tinjogope kwannope chilo ni musi. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Mitima jenu tijigumbale woga wa kila chichinchiwone. Kwaikaga kundaŵi tinchisala kuti, ‘Mmbaya ikaliji chilo,’ ni kwaikaga chilo tinchisala kuti ‘Mmbaya ikaliji kundaŵi.’ <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachimmusya sooni ku Misili ni meli, ulendo walanjile kuti ngammujila sooni. Kweleko chinkalinje kulisumisya mwasyene kwa ŵammagongo ŵenu mme achikapolo, nambo ngapagwa mundu jutakasache kunsuma.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ni Ŵaisilaeli ku chilambo cha Ŵamoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Aga ni maloŵe ga chilanga cha Ambuje Akunnungu chiŵanlamulile che Musa kuti atende ni Ŵaisilaeli mu chilambo cha Ŵamoabu, konjechesya maloŵe ga chilanga gegala giŵapanganyisye Ambuje Akunnungu ni Ŵaisilaeli kwele ku litumbi lya Sinai. <verse eid="DEU 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Che Musa ŵaaŵilasile Ŵaisilaeli wose ni kwasalila “Mwanya nnyiweni mwachinsyene Ambuje Akunnungu iŵantesile mwenye jwa ku Misili ni ŵakamusi ŵakwe ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ni ŵandu wose ŵa mchilambo chakwe. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Mwachinsyene mwaiweni iputiko yekulungwa ni ilosyo ni yakusimonjeka yaitesile. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Nambo mpaka lelo jino Ambuje Akunnungu nganannechelela mmanyilile yaikwendelechela. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Kwa yaka alobaini uneji nannongwesye kuchipululu, yakuwala yenu nganiiwisala namose italawanda yenu nganiilala mmakongolo mwenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Nganinlyaga nkate namose nganinng'waga divai pane nkologo wauliwose, kuti mmanyilile yakuti Ŵelewo ni ŵaali Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Pamwaichenje apano, che Sihoni mwenye jwa ku Heshiboni ni che Ogu mwenye jwa ku Bashani ŵaiche kukuputana ngondo ni uwe, nambo twaapundile. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Twachijigele chilambo chao ni kwapa ngosyo sya Lubeni ni Gadi ni nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase kuti chiŵe chao. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Kwayele nlilolechesye kugakamulichisya maloŵe gose ga lilangano li kuti indu yenu injendechele yambone mu kila chindu chinkuchipanganya.”<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Lelo jino ŵanyamwe wose njimi paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kutandilila ilongola ŵa ngosyo ni achakulu ŵenu ni achalume ŵane wose, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />achiŵankwenu ni ŵanache ŵenu ni achalendo ŵakutama pasikati jenu kutandilila ŵakutemanya sasu ni ŵakuntechelanga mesi, <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Nlinji apano lelo kutenda lilangano li lyati Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, akutenda ni ŵanyamwe ni kukunda malajisyo gakwe, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />antende ŵanyamwe lelojino kuŵa ŵandu ŵakwe kusyene, nombewo taŵe Akunnungu ŵenu, mpela iŵatite kunlanjila ŵanyamwe ni achachekulu ŵenu che Ibulahimu ni che Isaka ni che Yakubu. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Lilangano li ni kulumbila ku Ambuje Akunnungu ngakutenda ni ŵanyamwe pe, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />nambo nombe kwa ŵandu ŵane ŵanganaŵa pamo ni uwe lelojino.”<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene nkwimanyilila itwatite kutama ku Misili ni itujesile tulinkupita pasikati ja ilambo ya ŵandu ŵane ni kwika apano. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Kweleko mwaiweni inyago yao yakuchima, minungu ja kusepa ni itela ni maganga ni madini ga feza ni sahabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Nlilochesye ngasapagwa mundu jwalijose jwannume pane jwankongwe, pane nlongo njenu atamuno lukosyo lwalulilose lwaluli apano lelojino luchiŵaleche Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ni kwaula kujitumichila minungu ja ilambo ine. Yelei chiŵe mpela nchiga ŵachiumele ni kuŵa chitela chachikusogola ikoko. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Naga pakumala kupilikana maloŵe ga ali lilangano li linnumbilile, apagwaga mundu jwakulisalila nsyene achitiji kuti ngapagwa lichilyasimane, akuno ali nkwendelechela kutenda makani, yele chiinjonanje ŵanawose, ŵandu ŵambone ni ŵangalumbana. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Ambuje Akunnungu ngasanlechelesya mundu jo, lutumbilo lwa Ambuje Akunnungu pamo ni wiu chiikolele kwa mundu jo. Malweso gose gagalembekwe mu chitabu chi chiichapata, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu wo chammulaje mundu jo, akapagwa pachilambo. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu tachimmika pajika kuti akaŵa jumo mwa ngosyo syose sya Ŵaisilaeli kuti lyasimane limbulunga malinga ni malweso gose gagalembekwe mu chitabu cha lilangano li.”<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />“Pa moŵa gagakuika, iŵelesi yenu ni achalendo kutyochela ilambo yakutalika taiwone Ambuje Akunnungu yatite kuichisya mu chilambo chi limbulunga ni masauko. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Chilambo chose tichiŵe lipululu, chigumbele njete ni baluti, sooni tachijila kuti mu chilambo mo ngamukumela chindu chilichose. Chiŵe mpela Ambuje Akunnungu paŵajijonasile misi ja Sodoma ni Gomola ni Adima ni Seboimu kwa chisongolo chao chachikali. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose tachiusya kuti, ‘Ana ligongo chichi Ambuje Akunnungu ŵachijonasile chilambo chi? Ana ligongo aŵele ni lutumbilo lwakogoya lwanti yelei?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Nipele ŵandu tasale kuti, ‘Ligongo ŵandu ŵa, ŵalilesile lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa achachekulu ŵao liŵalitesile katema kaŵakopwesye ku chilambo cha ku Misili, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />ŵajawile kujitumichila ni kujipopelela minungu jine, janganajipopeleleje chitandilile cho, minungu jati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaakanyisye kujipopelela. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile kwannope ŵandu ŵa, ni ŵapelechele malweso gose gagalembekwe mu chitabu chi. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile kwannope ŵandu ŵakwe wo, ni ŵaatupwile mu chilambo chao ni ŵaponyisye mu chilambo chachilendo, kwele kwaakutama mpaka lelojino.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />“Indu yaisisikwe ili ya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, nambo yosepe yaiunukwile yeleyo ili yetu uwe ni uŵelesi wetu moŵa gose pangali mbesi, kuti tukombole kugapanganya maloŵe gose ga malajisyo ga.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Mashelaiti gakutendekwa ŵasambano ni upile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Che Musa ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta kuti, “Ngumpanga nsagule, pasikati ja upile ni malweso. Indu yele yose pachiityochele kukwenu, kwakulikose kuchimme ku chilambo kutampwilinganye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nipele nkumbuchileje chindu chakusagula. <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />Iŵaga mmwe ni iŵelesi yenu chimwaujilile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, kwa mitima jenu jose ni kupilikanichisya malajisyo gakwe ganampele lelojino, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />pele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, tachinkolela chanasa ni tachimmusya kutyochela mu ilambo ine, kwele kuŵampwilingenye ko, ni kuntesya indu yenu injendechele yambone sooni. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Nachiŵamuno ampwilingenye malo gakutalichila nnope mu chilambo, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tansonganganye kutyochela kweleko ni kummusya. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />Tachimmusya ku chilambo chichaliji cha achatati ŵenu ni mmwe chinchitende chenu. Tachintenda indu yenu injendechele yambone kwannope ni kuntenda mme achajinji kwapunda achatati ŵenu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, tachintenda ŵanyamwe ni iŵelesi yenu nkole mitima ja kumpilikanichisya kuti munnonyele kwa mitima jenu jose ni kwa mbumu jenu jose, nkole umi. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tagatesye malwesyo gose ga gaasimane ŵammagongo ŵenu ŵaŵannagasisye. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Chimmuje ni kwapilikaniichisya Ambuje Akunnungu ni kugakamula malajisyo gakwe gose gingunlajisya lelojino. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tantende injendelechele yambone mu kila chindu chinkuchipanganya; tinkole ŵanache achajinji ni ng'ombe syasijinji, ni migunda jenu chijityosye magungulo gamajinji. Pakuŵa tiyaanonyele sooni kuntenda nkole mboka mpela iŵatite kunonyelwa kwapa mboka achatati ŵenu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />chinkole mboka iŵaga chimwapilikanichisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kugakamulisya makanyo ni malajisyo gakwe gagalembekwe mu chitabu chi, ni kwagalauchila Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kwa mtima ŵenu wose ni kwa mumbu jenu jose.”<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />“Malajisyo gangumpa lelo jino ganigaŵa gakulimba kukwenu ni nganigaŵa kwakutalika ni ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Nganigaŵa kwinani kwati njile, ‘Ŵaani ŵatakwele kwaula kwinani kutujigalila, aiche kutusalila kuti tujitichisye?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Namose nganigaŵa peesi ja bahali kwati njile, ‘Ŵani tajomboche bahali kwaula kutujigalila aiche kutusalila, kuti tujitichisye?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Ngwamba, liloŵe lili chiŵandi ni ŵanyamwe, lili mukang'wa syenu ni mmitima jenu kuti nkombole kwitichisya.”<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Mpilikane, lelojino ngumpa nsagulanje, indu yambone pane yangalumbana ni chiwa pane umi. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Iŵaga chingajitichisye makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu gingumpa lelojino, mwaanonyelaga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ni kulikuya litala lyakwe ni kugakamula malajisyo gakwe ni makanyo ni mashalaiti gakwe, chinkole umi ni kuŵa achajinji ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tachimpa upile mu chilambo chichinjinjile ni kuchitenda chenu. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Nambo iŵaga chinlyungasikwe ni kukana kumpilikanichisya, ni kuntesya kujipopelela minungu jine ni kujitumichila, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />ngunsalila lelo jino, kusyene chinjonasikwe. Ngantamilisya yaka yejinji ku chilambo chinkwaula kuchitenda chenu, kwele peesi kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Lelojino ngusiŵilanga kwinani ni chilambo iŵe ŵaumboni pasikati jetu, kuti nampele kusagula pasikati ja umi pane chiwa, ni upile pane malweso. Nipele nsagule umi kuti nkole umi, mmwe ni uŵelesi wenu. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />Munnonyele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ni kulipilikanichisya liloŵe lyakwe ni kukamulangana nawo. Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, ali umi wenu, ni tachimpa yaka yejinji kuti ntame mu chilambo chiŵalanjile kwapa achachekulu ŵenu, che Ibulahimu ni che Isaka ni che Yakubu.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Che Yoshua akuŵa pamalo pa che Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Kuŵalanga 27:12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Nipele che Musa ŵajendelechele kwasalila Ŵaisilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />achitiji, “Sambano une ngwete yaka mia moja na ishilini, ngangombola sooni kunlongosya, ni Ambuje Akunnungu asalile nganyomboka lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, talongolele mbujo mwenu, taajonanje ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine ŵakutama kweleko kuti mjigale chilambo chao chiŵe chenu. Che Yoshua taŵe chilongola ŵenu mpela yatite Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Nombe Ambuje Akunnungu tiŵatendele ŵandu wo nti iŵatendele che Sihoni ni che Ogu, mamwenye ŵa Ŵaamoli pamo ni chilambo chao. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Ambuje Akunnungu chantendekasye mwapunde, ni ŵanyamwe chimwatendele mpela indite kunlajisya. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Nlimbangane ni kukola ntima wangajogopa, nkakola lipamba namose kwajogopa, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu tachiŵa pamo ni ŵanyamwe ngaaleka kunkamusyanga ni nganjasanga.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Nipele che Musa ŵammilasile che Yoshua ni kunsalila mbujo mwa Ŵaisilaeli wose, “Nlimbangane ni kukola ntima wangajogopa, pakuŵa mmwe ni uchimwalongosye ŵandu ŵa kwaula kukuchijigala chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalanjile achachekulu ŵao, ni mmwe chimwagaŵile chilambo cho kuti chiwe chao. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Ambuje Akunnungu ni utachinnongosya nombe taŵe pamo ni ŵanyamwe, ngaaleka kunkamuchisyanga namose kunjasa, nkajogopa namose kupwa ntima.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusyoma Lilajisyo kila chaka cha saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Nipele che Musa ŵalembile lilajisyo lyo ni kwapa ŵambopesi ŵa lukosyo lwa Lawi, uŵajigalaga Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu pamo ni achakulu wose ŵa Chiislaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Che Musa ŵalajisye achitiji, “Kumbesi kwa kila chaka cha saba chichiŵe chaka chakulechelesya magambo, pa lyuŵa lyekulungwa lya Chindimba cha Masakasa, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Katema Ŵaisilaeli wose paakwika paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, peuto patapasagule, mwasyomele Ŵaisilaeli wose malajisyo ga. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Mwasonganganye pamo achalume wose ni achakongwe ni ŵanache wose pamo ni achalendo ŵakutama mmisi jenu, kuti apikanile ni kulijiganya kwachimbichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ni kupilikanichisya mkuipanganya yose yaili mu chitabu cha malajisyo chi. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Kwanti yele iŵelesi yenu yangaikumanyilila malajisyo ga apilikane ni kulijiganya kwachimbichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, mmoŵa gose gachinchitama mu chilambo chinkwaula kuchijigala ni kuŵa chenu kwele pesi kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Musa akupegwa malajisyo ga mbesi ni Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, “Mpilikane, lyuwa lya chiwa chenu liŵandichile. Mumilanje che Yoshua nkaiche nao mu Hema takatifu liuto lichinape malajisyo ga masengo.” Nipele, che Musa ni che Yoshua ŵajawile ku Hema Takatifu. <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaichilile mwelemo kutyochela mu luchanamila lwa liunde lulwajimi pa nnango wa kwinjilila mu Hema.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, “Nnole mmandichile kuwa ni pachimmwe ŵandu chaaneche une ni kujijaulila minungu jine ja mwele mu chilambo mwakwaula kutama. Chaaneche une ni kulitema lilangano lyangu linaŵisile pamo ni ŵanyawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Pachatende yeleyo, chinaatumbilile ni kwaleka nombewo tajonasiche. Tilyaichilile limbulunga ni masausyo gamajinji, kwika mwakumanyilila kuti indu yi ikwasimana pakuŵa une Akunnungu ŵao nganima pamo ni ŵanyawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Chingane kwakamusya ŵanyawo sooni pakuŵa andendele ugongomalo ni kujipopelela minungu jine.”<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Sambano nlembe lujimbo lu, mwajiganye Ŵaisilaeli ni kwalajisya alujimbe lujimbo lu kuti luŵe umboni kukwangu nkati Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Pachimale kwajinjisya mu chilambo chachajila chachikufai kwa kulima ni kulanga nti inalanjile achachekulu ŵao, ŵanyawo patachilya ni kwikuta ni indu yao kwajendelela yambone, tajigalauchile minungu ja chilendo ni kijipopelela, chaneche une ni kulitema lilangano lyangu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Patilyasimane limbulunga ni masausyo, pele lujimbo lu ngaluliŵalikwa mu iŵelesi yao, chiluŵe nti umboni kukwao. Ngunaŵe kwajinjisya mu chilambo chinaalanjile, ngusimanyilila nganisyo syawo.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Nipele che Musa ŵalembile lujimbo lula lyuŵa lilalila ni kwajiganya Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalajisye che Yoshua mwana ju che Nuni, ni ŵansalile “Mme jwakulimbangana ni jwangajogopa, pakuŵa chimwalongosye Ŵaisilaeli ku chilambo chinalanjile kwa kulumbila kwapa, none chinjiŵa pamo nomwe.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Che Musa paŵamasile kulemba mu chitabu maloŵe ga malajisyo go kutandilila kundanda mpaka kumbesi, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />ŵasalile ŵambopesi ŵaŵaliji Ŵalawi ŵaŵajigalaga Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Nchijigale achi chitabu cha Lilajisyo chi nkachiŵiche mumbali mwa Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. Chitameje pelepo nti umboni kukwenu. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Pakuŵa ngummanyilila intite kuŵa ŵakugalaukagalauka ni ŵamakani. Iŵaga nganimunjitichisya Ambuje Akunnungu katema kanaliji jwanjumi pamo ni mmwe, chiiŵe uli pachinjiwa une? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Mwasonganganye paujo pangu achakulu wose ŵa ngosyo syenu ni ŵakamusi ŵenu wose, kuti mechete maloŵe ga agapikane, ni kwinani ni chilambo iŵe ŵaumboni. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Pakuŵa nguimanyilila kuti pakumala chiwa changu usyene chimme ŵachigongomalo ni kulileka litala linanlajisye kulikuya. Mmoŵa gagakwika chilinsimane limbulunga pakuŵa chintende chigongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ni kuntumbilisya kwa ipanganyo yenu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lujimbo lu che Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Che Musa ŵagasasile maloŵe ga lujimbo lula paujo pa nsongangano wa Ŵaisilaeli wose.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Mpilikane mwanya ŵanawose ŵanli Kwinani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">ŵanyamwe ŵanawose ŵanli pachilambo mpikanile maloŵe ginguŵecheta.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Majiganyo gangu tigapatuche mpela mandondwa ga ula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">Maloŵe gangu gatuluche mpela mangame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">Nti manyuunyu ga ula pa mimela jamwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">Mpela ula jenandi pa mimela.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Pakuŵa chinalilape lina lya Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">ni ŵanyamwe njile, ‘Akunnungu ŵetu ali jwankulu!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />“Ambuje Akunnungu ali lwala, masengo gao gali ga utindimisyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">matala gao gali gagoloka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Akunnungu jwakulupilichika jwangali chilewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Akutenda yindu yaikuti kusachilwa ni pangali lusagu.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Nambo ŵanyamwe nganimma ŵakulupilichika kukwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">ŵanyamwe ngankuŵajilwa kuŵa wanache ŵakwe sooni, kwaligongo lya ugongomalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">Ŵanyamwe nli uŵelesi wachigongomalo ni ŵakulambusya.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Ana yeleyi ni inkuti kwalipa Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">ŵanya ŵakuloŵela unganinkola umanyilisi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Ana ŵele ngaŵa atati ŵenu uŵangumbile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Uŵampangenye ni kunlimbisya?”<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />“Nkumbuchile ya chikala, nganichisye iŵelesi ya kalakala yaipitile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">Mwausye achatati ŵenu chammanyisye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">Mwausye achachekulu ŵenu chansalile.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Akumanani paŵapele ŵandu ŵa ilambo malo gakutama gaŵe gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">paŵagaŵenye ŵandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">ŵaaŵichile mipika, malinga ni winji wa ŵanache ŵa Isilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Nambo ŵalisagulile uŵelesi u che Yakubu kuŵa ŵandu ŵankwe nsyene.”<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />“Ŵaasimene ku chilambo cha lipululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">mu ukweti wangali chindu kujikupepela mbungo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Ŵaalindilile ni kwagosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">mpela mundu yakuti kulindilila liso lyakwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Mpela kapungu jwakwajiganya wanache ŵakwe kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">ali atambasukwile mapapiko gakwe kuti akapatuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaagosile Ŵaisilaeli kuti akagwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Ambuje Akunnungu jikape ŵaalongwesye ŵandu ŵakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">Nganapagwa nnungu jwaine jwakunkamuchisya.”<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />“Ŵaatesile apitile mu ikwesya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">nombewo ŵalile magowolo ga mmigunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Ŵaapele uuchi palwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">ni mauta ga mseituni waumesile pa litaka lyalili ni maganga.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Ng'ombe syao ni ngondolo syao syakopweche maŵele gamajinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">ŵakwete ngondolo syambone ni mbusi syambone ni ng'ombe syambone nnope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">ŵaapele ngano jambone nnope ni divai jambone nnope.”<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />“Ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu ŵasichile kwannope nambo ŵaliji ŵakugalaukagalauka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">ŵajimbele ni kukola itambi ni kutindigala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">Ŵannesile Akunnungu uŵagumbile, ŵankanile Lwala lwa Ukulupusyo wao.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Ŵantendekasisye Akunnungu akole wiu ni chisongo, ligongo lya minungu jao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">ŵantesile atumbile kwa ipanganyo yao yakuchimasya.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Ŵatyosisye mbopesi syakutinisya kwa masoka, yanganaŵa Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">minungu janganajimanyilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">minungu jasambano jajimanyiche nachiŵandika muno</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">Minungu janganajijogopanga achachekulu wenu.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Ŵaaliŵalile Akunnungu jwali nkulupusyo jwankulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">jwelejo juŵammeleche.”<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />“Ambuje Akunnungu ŵachiweni chindu chi ni ŵaakanile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">pakuŵa ŵatumbilikasiswe ni achiŵanagwe ŵachilume ni ŵachikwongwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Ŵatite, ‘Ngaanyendelechela kwakamusya,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">‘Nole mbesi jao chijiŵe jantiuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Pakuŵa ŵelewo aŵele uŵelesi welyungasiche, ni ŵangakukulupilichika.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Andesile ngole wiu kwa chindu chati ngaŵa nnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">andumbilikasisye kwa inyago yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">chinjatenda ŵakolele wiu ŵandu ŵaangakwamanyilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">chinaatumbilikasye kwakwatumia ŵandu ŵakulowela.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Pakuŵa lutumbilo lwangu lukolele nti mooto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">lukutinisya mpaka peuto pa ŵandu ŵawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">chilutinisye chilambo pamo ni magowolo gakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">ni kukolesya mooto pa misingi ja itumbi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“ ‘Chinjaichisya limbulunga lyangali mbesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">chinjaputa ni mipamba jangu jose.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Tachiwa kwa sala ni kukolela mooto pa chiilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">tachiwa kwa ilwele yakogoya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Tinaichisye inyama yachikali yaaguluchile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">ni majoka gagali ni sumu gaalume.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ngondo tijiichisye iwa yejinji paasa pa majuumba genu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">ni mmajumba gao lipamba chilijenele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">Achachanda ŵenu ni achiŵali ŵenu chaulajikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">namose ŵanache ŵakonga pamo ni achachekulu ŵaali ni uli.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Natite chinaajonanje tikitiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">ni kwatesya akakumbuchilwa sooni ni mundu jwalijose.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Nganinaalechelela ŵammagongo ŵao alilape,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">ŵammagongo ŵao akaganichisya ine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">akaika kusala kuti, akombwele kwajonanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">ni une Ambuje Akunnungu nganimbanganya chachilichose.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />“Ŵandu ŵa chilambo cha ku Isilaeli ali ŵandu ŵangali umanyilisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">ŵandu wo nganakola lunda.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Akakwete lunda akaimanyilile kuti ligongo chi ŵalepele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">akakombwele kwimanyilila mbesi jao chijiwe uli!<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Ikukomboleka chinauli jwangondo jumo jwa ŵammagongo kwapunda ŵandu elufu moja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">pane ŵangondo ŵaŵili ŵa ŵammagongo kwapunda ŵandu elufu kumi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">ngaikaŵe kuti Akunnungu jwao ŵajasile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">ni Ambuje Akunnungu jwao ŵalesile.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Namose ŵammagongo ŵetu akwimanyilila kuti minungu jao nganijikola machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">mpela Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Pakuŵa ŵammagongo ŵao ahalibiche kwa ugongomalo mpela ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">ili mpela misabibu yaikusogola isogosi yakuipa ni yaili ni sumu,<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Divai jao jili mpela divai jekolochekwe kutyochela ni sumu jakalipa ja majoka.”<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Ambuje Akunnungu akuikumbuchila yaitesile ŵammagongo ŵao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">akulindilila katema kambone kakwaputa<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Kuuchisya kuli pa une,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">uneji chinaliuchisye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">pachijiiche ndaŵi jakwe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">pakuŵa lyuŵa lyao lya limbulunga liiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">mbesi jao jiŵandichile kwannope.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Ambuje Akunnungu chiŵachenjele ŵandu ŵakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">ni kwakolela chanasa ŵakutumichila ŵao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">katema pachiŵaone amalilwe machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">atamuno pangali jwasigele, mundu jwataŵikwe pane junganataŵikwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu tachiuusya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">‘Jilikwapi minungu jenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">lwala lumwaluutuchile kuti mme salama?’<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Jilikwapi minungu jenu jijalile mbopesi jenu jakutinisya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">ni kung'wa sadaka ja divai jimwapele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Nipele ni jijimuche, jinkamuchisya;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">nneche jele minungu jo jinlindilile!”<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />“Nnole une ndili Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">ni ngapagwa jwine nambo unepe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">une nguulaga ni kusyusya;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">kuulasya ni kulamya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">ni ngapagwa jwalijose jwakukombola kukanila achila chinguchipanganya.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Kusyene mpela une Akunnungu jungutama pangali mbesi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">ngunyakula nkono wangu ni kulumbila,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />iŵaga timmone ndili ngunola upanga wangu wa kunyesima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">ni kugolosya nkono kutyosya ulamusi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">Tinjiliusisya kwa ŵammagongo ŵangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">tinjajamuka aŵala ŵakunjima.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Mipamba jangu tijichejele pyuu kwa myasi jao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">ni upanga wangu tiuulaje wose ŵaakunganila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">Ngananneka jwalijose jwakumenyana ni une</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">namose ŵaaulele ni ŵataŵikwe chachiwa.”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />“Ŵanyamwe ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose, mwasangalalile ŵandu ŵakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu taliuchisye kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">taliuchisye kwa ŵammagongo ŵakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">ni kulechelesya sambi sya ŵandu ŵakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Che Musa ni che Yoshua mwanache ju che Nuni, ŵagasasile maloŵe gose ga lujimbo lo kuti Ŵaisilaeli agapikanile.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maloŵe ga mbesi ga che Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Che Musa paŵamasile kwasalila ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli aga maloŵe gose ga, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />ŵasaalile sooni kuti, “Ngaŵiche muntima malajisyo gose gingumpanga lelojino ga. Nkusachilwa mwalamulile ŵanache ŵenu kuti agapilikanichisye kwakukulupilichika maloŵe gose ga malajisyo ga. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Pakuŵa malajisyo ga nganigaŵa maloŵe pe nambo gali umi wenu. Ngapilikanichisye malajisyo ga ni ŵanyamwe chinkatame moŵa gamajinji ku chilambo chinkwaula kuchitenda chenu pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Lyuŵa lilyolyo, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Nkakwele pa itumbi ya Abalimu, mpaka chitumbi cha Nebo chachili ku chilambo cha ku Moabu, mwakulolegana ni musi wa ku Yeliko, nchilole chilambo cha Kanaani chele chingwapa Ŵaisilaeli kuti chiŵe chao. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Nipele chinkawilile kukoko ku chitumbi ko mpela nkulugwenu che Aloni juŵawilile ku chitumbi cha Holi, <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Ligongo ŵanyamwe wose ŵanaŵaŵili nganinlosya chikulupilichiko kukwangu paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli. Ndaŵi jimwaliji akula ku meesi ga Meliba, kuŵandikana ni musi wa ku Kadeshi, kulipululu lya Sini, nganimunjimbichisya une paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Kwayele chinchione chilambo cho mmbujo mwenu, nambo nganjaula kwinjila ku chilambo chingwapa Ŵaisilaeli cho.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Che Musa akwapa upile ngosyo sya Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Weleu ni upile ŵati che Musa ŵapele Ŵaisilaeli akanaŵe kuwa.<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Ŵatite: Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaiche kutyochela pa chitumbi cha Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">ŵakopochele nti lyuŵa lyaikuti kukopochela, pachanya pa chitumbi cha Seili;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">ŵaalanguchisye ŵandu ŵakwe kutyochela pachitumbi cha Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Ŵaiche pamo ni achikatumetume ŵakwinani elufu kumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">ni lilamba lili nkukolela pankono wao wakunlyo.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Ambuje Akunnungu, akwanonyela ŵandu ŵakwe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">ni kwalindilila aŵala ŵaali ŵakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Kwayele, achikatumetume ŵa kwinani akugona manguku paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">ni kugapikanila malajisyo gakwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Che Musa ŵatulamwile kuti tupilikanichesye malajisyo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">chili chindu cha ntengo wekulungwa nnope mu chilambo chetu.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵaliji mwenye jwa Ŵaisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">katema ilongola ni ngosyo syose paŵasongangene pamo,<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Che Musa ŵaŵechete maloŵe gakwalumba lukosyo lwa Lubeni:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Lukosyo lwa Lubeni lukawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">ni ŵandu ŵakwe, akaŵa ŵandu kanandi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Nkati lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵasalile kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Ŵalakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, mpilikanile kulila kwa ŵandu ŵa Lukosyo lwa Yuda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">mwalumbikanye sooni ni ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine sya ku Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Mputane kwaligongo lyao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">mwakamuchisye pakumenyana ni ŵammagongo ŵao.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Upile kwa lukosyo lwa Lawi, ŵatite kuti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, mwape ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Ŵalawi chinkusala kwa Tumimu ni Ulimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">ŵele ŵandu ŵaali ŵakukulupilichika umwalinjile kwele ku Masa pa meesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">ni kulimbana nao pa mesi ga Meliba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Ŵele ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Ŵalawi ŵalosisye kukulupilichika kwakukulungwa kukwenu kupunda kwa achaŵelesi ŵao ni achalongo achinjawo pane achiŵana ŵao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">ŵajitichisye lilajisyo lyenu ni aŵele ŵakukulupilichika pa lilangano lyenu.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Ni chiŵajiganye ŵandu ŵenu kulipilikanichisya lilajisyo lyenu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">chantyochesye mbopesi syakutinisya pachilisa penu.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, mwape upile akole ni machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">nomwe nganonyele masengo gakugapanganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">mwatende ŵammagongo ŵao akakola machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">mwapatusye akajimuka sooni.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Upile kwa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Lwelelu ni lukosyo lwakulunonyela Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kululindilila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">nombelo lukutama salama pachiŵandi nao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Ambuje Akunnungu akulugosa muusi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">nombejo akutamanga pasikati jawo.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Yankati lukosyo lwa Yusufu ŵatite:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Ambuje Akunnungu achipe upile chilambo chao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">kwa upile wa ula ni meesi gagakutyochela paasi,<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />chilambo chao chikole upile kwa isogosi yambone yaikupagwa katema ka lyuŵa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">ni ikole isogosi yejinji pa kila katema;<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />ni mmatumbi gakwe ga chikala, gagumbele magungulo gambone,<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />chilambo chao chigumbaswe ni indu yose yambone, indu yambone yaipele upile Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Ŵelewo ŵaŵechete kutyochela pa chisukutu chichakolelaga mooto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">au upile wu wasimane ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yusufu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Juŵaliji chilongola pasikati ja achapwakwe,<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Che Yusufu akwete machili mpela ng'ombe nkambaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">maŵengwa gakwe gali mpela ga tonde ja njati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Chagapanganyichisye masengo ga kututa ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">chiŵaatute mpaka kuchipelele chilambo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Che Efulaimu chaŵe ni maŵengwa go elufu kumi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">nombe che Manase chaŵe ni maŵengwa go maelufu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Yankati lukosyo lwa Sabuloni ni lukosyo lwa Isakali, ŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Sabuloni, asichile mu ulendo wao wakwausya malonda mu bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">Nombe che Isakari, ipanje yakwe ijonjesyeche ali pamangwakwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Chiŵaalaliche achalendo ajaule ku matumbi gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">ni kutyosya mbopesi syasikusachilwa kweleko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Pakuŵa ŵanyao chapate ipanje yaijinji kutyochela ni masengo gaakugapanganya ku bahali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">ni indu yakuikolosya munsanga wa ku mbwani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Yankati lukosyo lwa Gadi, ŵatite:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Alapikwe Akunnungu jwakungaŵila Gadi malo jekulungwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi akuuŵilila nti lisimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">ankwachule nkono pane liuwo.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Ŵalisagulile malo gambone kupunda gane gose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">ŵelewo ŵapegwilwe malo jajikulungwa jajikusachilwa kupegwa chilongola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Ŵalongwesye ŵandu kwapilikanichisya Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">katema ilongola ŵa Ŵaisilaeli paŵasongangene.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Yankati lukosyo lwa Dani ŵatite</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani ali mpela lisimba lyamwana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">jwaakuguluka alinkutyochela ku Bashani.<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Yankati lukosyo lwa Nafutali ŵatite</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Alakwe Nafutali umpegwile upile kwannope ni Ambuje Akunnungu jwaali jwambone kukwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">lisi lyenu liiche mpaka kulujenda kwa litanda lya Galilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Yankati lukosyo lwa Asheli ŵatite:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Asheli akwete upile kwapunda ngosyo syose sya che Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">ŵelewo chatendelwe kwa lusagu ni achalongo achinjakwe wose;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">ni chilambo chenu chichigumbale miseituni.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Misi jenu chijilindililwe ni makumba gamaleu gagali ni milango ja isyano</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">ni chijiugalikwe katema kose.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Che Musa ŵaamalisisye kuŵecheta achitiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">“Ŵanyamwe Ŵaisilaeli, ngapagwa ŵali mpela Akunnungu ŵenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">ŵelewo ŵali kwinani, akutuluka pasi pano kukunkamuchisya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">ŵelewo akupita mwinani kwa ung'alime wakwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Akunnungu ŵa moŵa gose pangali mbesi ali chiutuchilo chenu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">machili gao gakuoneka pachilambo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Ŵatopwele ŵammagongo ŵenu paujo penu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">ni ŵalamwile kuti mwaulaje.<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Kwayele, Ŵaisilaeli chintame salama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">ŵanyamwe uŵelesi wa che Yakubu ngaansausya mundu jwalijose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">ku chilambo chachigumbele magungulo ni divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">lisi lyalikunyelelwa ula kutyochela kwinani.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Ŵanyamwe Ŵaisilaeli nkwete upile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Ngapagwa ŵali mpela ŵanyamwe, chilambo cha ŵandu ŵaŵankulupwisye Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Ambuje Akunnungu nsyene ni ŵaali chakulichinga chenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">ni upanga wenu kuti anlindilile ni kuntendekasya mwapunde ŵammagongo ŵenu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Ŵammagongo ŵenu chaiche kukummenda mwakolele chanasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nombe ŵanyamwe chimwaliŵatile.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Nipele, che Musa ŵatyosile ku chiŵata cha ku Moabu, mpaka ku chitumbi cha Nebo, ni ŵakwesile mpaka ku lusonga lwa litumbi lya Pisiga lwaluŵandichile ku Yeliko. Pelepo Akunnungu ni paŵaalosisye chilambo chosepe: Kutandilila ku Gileadi mpaka kumpoto kusyene kwa musi wa Dani; <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Chilambo chosepe cha Nafutali, ni ilambo yosepe ya Efulaimu ni chilambo chose cha Manase, ni chilambo cha Yuda mpaka ku Bahali ja Meditelania; <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />sooni ŵannosisye ukweti wa ku Negebu ni malo ga lichemba lya ku Yeliko, musi waugumbele itela yaikuŵilanjikwa mitende, mpaka ku Soali. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, “Chilambo chi ni chinaalanjile che Ibulahimu, ni che Isaka ni che Yakubu kuti chinaape uŵelesi wao. Nannosisye, nambo mmwe ngankuika kweleko.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Nipele, che Musa jwakwatumichila jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵawilile pelepo kuchilambo cha ku Moabu, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kuŵecheta. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansichile kulichemba lya ku Moabu, lyaliŵandichile ku musi wa Besi Peoli; nambo mpaka lelo jino ngali ŵapamanyi peuto pasyene paasiichikwe. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Musa yaliji mia moja ni ishilini, nipele ŵawile; ŵaliji chiŵela ni machili, ni meso gao galiji chiŵela alinkulola. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵalisile malilo gakwe moŵa selasini kuchiŵata cha ku Moabu. Nipele ŵamyalele kulila ni ŵajanukwile mataanga.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Che Yoshua mwanache ju che Nuni ŵagumbele ntima wa luunda kwannope, pakuŵa che Musa ŵansagwile jwelejo. Ŵaisilaeli ŵampikanile che Yoshua ni kugakuya malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu gaŵampele che Musa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Kutandilila pelepo, paliji pangali jwakulondola mu Isilaeli mpela che Musa, juŵaŵechetaga ni Ambuje Akunnungu meso ni meso. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Pangali jwakulondola jwine juŵatesile ilosyo ni yakusimosya mpela yele Ambuje Akunnungu iŵasalile che Musa kuti aitende pameso pa mwenye jwa ku Misili, pamo ni ŵakamusi ŵakwe ni ŵandu ŵa mu chilambo mwakwe. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Pangali jwakulondola jwine juŵatesile indu yaikulungwa ni yakogoya mpela iŵaitesile che Musa paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli wosepe.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>